msgid "Project setup"
msgstr "项目配置"

#: manual/api/algebra.md:29
msgid "`algebra` is the structure layer only. If you also need the shared upstream scalar abstractions, add them explicitly:"
msgstr "`algebra` 只负责结构层。如果你的代码还要直接使用共享的上游标量抽象，把这些依赖一起加上："

