msgstr "推荐的 `moon.pkg` 导入写法："

#: manual/api/algebra.md:49
msgid "Use `@algebra` for linear-algebra structure traits. Import `@lf_alg` and `@lf_arith` directly when your code also needs the shared upstream abstractions."
msgstr "`@algebra` 用来引用线性代数结构 traits；如果代码还需要共享的上游抽象，再直接导入 `@lf_alg` 和 `@lf_arith`。"

#: manual/api/algebra.md:52
msgid "Matrix shape traits"
msgstr "矩阵形状 trait"

#: manual/api/algebra.md:87
msgid "`MatrixShape` is for matrix-like or tensor-like objects with observable dimensions. `VectorShape` is for vector-like objects with observable length. These traits do not claim any algebraic operation."
msgstr "`MatrixShape` 表示可观测二维形状的对象；`VectorShape` 表示可观测长度的向量式对象。它们不声明任何代数运算。"

#: manual/api/algebra.md:136
msgid "Represents vector-like objects with additive linear structure. It does not require element-wise multiplication, dot product, norm, or a global zero."
msgstr "表示具有加法线性结构的向量式对象。它不要求逐元素乘法、内积、范数或全局零元。"

#: manual/api/algebra.md:139
msgid "Reach for `VecMulVector` only when an algorithm really needs element-wise multiplication:"
msgstr "只有算法确实需要逐元素乘法时，才使用 `VecMulVector`："

#: manual/api/algebra.md:225
msgid "Represents matrix-like objects with observable shape and same-category transpose. It does not require matrix multiplication because dynamic rectangular matrix multiplication is only defined for compatible runtime shapes."
msgstr "表示具有可观测形状和同类型转置操作的矩阵式对象。它不要求矩阵乘法，因为动态矩形矩阵乘法只在运行时形状兼容时才有定义。"

#: manual/api/algebra.md:229
msgid "The trait does not require dense storage, contiguous memory, direct element indexing, or mutation support."
msgstr "该 trait 也不要求稠密存储、连续内存、直接元素索引或可变操作。"

#: manual/api/algebra.md:232
msgid "Use the stronger traits only when the algorithm actually needs the extra operation:"
msgstr "只有算法确实需要额外运算时，才继续使用更强的 traits："

