msgstr "边界"

#: manual/api/algebra.md:293
msgid "Do not add `dot`, `norm`, or inner-product traits here unless the scalar mapping is modeled explicitly. The core algebra package is for minimal structure and same-category operations."
msgstr "不要在这里加入 `dot`、`norm` 或内积 trait，除非显式建模其标量映射。核心 algebra 包只放最小结构和同类型闭合运算。"

#: manual/api/arithmetic.md:3
msgid "API baseline for `Luna-Flow/linear-algebra/arithmetic` in the current `0.4.7` repository state."
msgstr "本页记录当前 `0.4.7` 仓库中 `Luna-Flow/linear-algebra/arithmetic` 的公开 API 基线。"

#: manual/api/arithmetic.md:8
msgid "`arithmetic` owns operation-level traits used by the linear-algebra package. An operation trait means “this operation is available”; it does not state algebraic laws. Algebraic law-bearing structure belongs in `linear-algebra/algebra`."
msgstr "`arithmetic` 拥有线性代数包使用的操作级 traits。操作 trait 只表示“该操作可用”，不声明代数律。带代数律的结构属于 `linear-algebra/algebra`。"

#: manual/api/arithmetic.md:14
msgid "If you want to use the linear-algebra operation traits together with the shared upstream abstractions, start with:"
msgstr "如果你要把线性代数操作 trait 和共享上游抽象一起使用，先加上这三条依赖："

