#: manual/api/arithmetic.md:155
msgid "This package must not import matrix, vector, or backend types. In the dependency graph, it sits below `algebra` and all backend packages."
msgstr "本包不能导入矩阵、向量或后端类型。在依赖方向上，它位于 `algebra` 和所有后端包之下。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:3
msgid "API baseline for `Luna-Flow/linear-algebra/backends/default` in the current `0.4.7` repository state."
msgstr "本页记录当前 `0.4.7` 仓库中 `Luna-Flow/linear-algebra/backends/default` 的公开 API 基线。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:8
msgid "`backends/default` provides owned wrapper types around the existing dense `mutable` and `immut` implementations. Because these wrappers are owned by the default backend package, the package can implement the public `@algebra` traits for them without violating MoonBit's foreign trait / foreign type rule."
msgstr "`backends/default` 为现有的稠密 `mutable` 与 `immut` 实现提供本包拥有的包装类型。因为这些包装类型属于默认后端包，所以这里可以为它们实现公开的 `@algebra` trait，而不会违反 MoonBit 的 foreign trait / foreign type 规则。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:26
msgid "Owned wrapper for the default mutable dense vector backend."
msgstr "默认可变稠密向量后端的自有包装类型。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:28
#: manual/api/backends/default.md:76
#: manual/api/backends/default.md:121
#: manual/api/backends/default.md:161
msgid "Constructors and accessors"
msgstr "构造与访问"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:30
msgid "`DenseVector::from_backend(inner : @mutable.Vector[T]) -> DenseVector[T]` wraps an existing mutable vector."
msgstr "`DenseVector::from_backend(inner : @mutable.Vector[T]) -> DenseVector[T]` 包装一个已有的可变向量。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:32
msgid "`DenseVector::from_array(data : Array[T]) -> DenseVector[T]` builds a mutable dense vector from an array."
msgstr "`DenseVector::from_array(data : Array[T]) -> DenseVector[T]` 从数组构造一个可变稠密向量。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:34
msgid "`DenseVector::make(length : Int, value : T) -> DenseVector[T]` builds a vector filled with `value`."
msgstr "`DenseVector::make(length : Int, value : T) -> DenseVector[T]` 构造一个所有元素都为 `value` 的向量。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:36
msgid "`DenseVector::inner(self) -> @mutable.Vector[T]` returns the wrapped mutable vector."
msgstr "`DenseVector::inner(self) -> @mutable.Vector[T]` 返回内部包装的可变向量。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:38
msgid "`DenseVector::length(self) -> Int` returns vector length."
msgstr "`DenseVector::length(self) -> Int` 返回向量长度。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:40
msgid "`DenseVector::op_get(self, index : Int) -> T` supports read indexing."
msgstr "`DenseVector::op_get(self, index : Int) -> T` 支持只读索引访问。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:43
#: manual/api/backends/default.md:91
#: manual/api/backends/default.md:130
#: manual/api/backends/default.md:170
#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:82
#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:125
msgid "Backend methods"
msgstr "后端方法"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:45
msgid "`DenseVector::scale(self, scalar : T) -> DenseVector[T]` scales the vector element-wise and returns a new backend value."
msgstr "`DenseVector::scale(self, scalar : T) -> DenseVector[T]` 对向量做逐元素缩放并返回新的默认后端值。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:47
msgid "`DenseVector::dot(self, other : DenseVector[T]) -> T` computes the scalar dot product."
msgstr "`DenseVector::dot(self, other : DenseVector[T]) -> T` 计算标量点积。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:49
msgid "`DenseVector::axpy(self, alpha : T, other : DenseVector[T]) -> DenseVector[T]` computes the BLAS-style linear combination `alpha * self + other`."
msgstr "`DenseVector::axpy(self, alpha : T, other : DenseVector[T]) -> DenseVector[T]` 计算 BLAS 风格的 `alpha * self + other`。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:52
#: manual/api/backends/default.md:97
