msgid "`@algebra.VecMulVector` when `T : Add + Neg + Mul`"
msgstr "当 `T : Add + Neg + Mul` 时的 `@algebra.VecMulVector`"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:74
msgid "Owned wrapper for the default mutable dense matrix backend."
msgstr "默认可变稠密矩阵后端的自有包装类型。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:78
msgid "`DenseMatrix::from_backend(inner : @mutable.Matrix[T]) -> DenseMatrix[T]` wraps an existing mutable matrix."
msgstr "`DenseMatrix::from_backend(inner : @mutable.Matrix[T]) -> DenseMatrix[T]` 包装一个已有的可变矩阵。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:80
msgid "`DenseMatrix::from_2d_array(data : Array[Array[T]]) -> DenseMatrix[T]` builds a matrix from row-major nested arrays."
msgstr "`DenseMatrix::from_2d_array(data : Array[Array[T]]) -> DenseMatrix[T]` 从按行组织的二维数组构造矩阵。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:82
msgid "`DenseMatrix::new(row : Int, col : Int, value : T) -> DenseMatrix[T]` builds a matrix filled with `value`."
msgstr "`DenseMatrix::new(row : Int, col : Int, value : T) -> DenseMatrix[T]` 构造一个所有元素都为 `value` 的矩阵。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:84
msgid "`DenseMatrix::inner(self) -> @mutable.Matrix[T]` returns the wrapped mutable matrix."
msgstr "`DenseMatrix::inner(self) -> @mutable.Matrix[T]` 返回内部包装的可变矩阵。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:86
msgid "`DenseMatrix::row(self) -> Int` returns row count."
msgstr "`DenseMatrix::row(self) -> Int` 返回行数。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:88
msgid "`DenseMatrix::col(self) -> Int` returns column count."
msgstr "`DenseMatrix::col(self) -> Int` 返回列数。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:93
msgid "`DenseMatrix::matvec(self, vector : DenseVector[T]) -> DenseVector[T]` multiplies the matrix by a default-backend dense vector and returns a new dense vector wrapper."
msgstr "`DenseMatrix::matvec(self, vector : DenseVector[T]) -> DenseVector[T]` 计算矩阵与默认后端稠密向量的乘积，并返回新的稠密向量包装类型。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:101
#: manual/api/backends/default.md:180
msgid "`@algebra.MatrixShape` and `@algebra.TransposeMatrix` for all `T`"
msgstr "任意 `T` 上的 `@algebra.MatrixShape` 和 `@algebra.TransposeMatrix`"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:102
#: manual/api/backends/default.md:181
msgid "`@algebra.AdditiveMatrix` when `T : Add + Neg`"
msgstr "当 `T : Add + Neg` 时的 `@algebra.AdditiveMatrix`"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:103
msgid "`@algebra.MatMulMatrix` when `T : Add + Neg + AddMonoid + Mul`"
msgstr "当 `T : Add + Neg + AddMonoid + Mul` 时的 `@algebra.MatMulMatrix`"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:119
msgid "Owned wrapper for the default immutable dense vector backend."
msgstr "默认不可变稠密向量后端的自有包装类型。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:159
msgid "Owned wrapper for the default immutable dense matrix backend."
msgstr "默认不可变稠密矩阵后端的自有包装类型。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:172
msgid "`ImmutableDenseMatrix::matvec(self, vector : ImmutableDenseVector[T]) -> ImmutableDenseVector[T]` multiplies the matrix by an immutable dense vector and returns a new immutable dense vector wrapper."
msgstr "`ImmutableDenseMatrix::matvec(self, vector : ImmutableDenseVector[T]) -> ImmutableDenseVector[T]` 计算矩阵与不可变稠密向量的乘积，并返回新的不可变稠密向量包装类型。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:182
msgid "`@algebra.MatMulMatrix` when `T : Add + Neg + Zero + Mul`"
msgstr "当 `T : Add + Neg + Zero + Mul` 时的 `@algebra.MatMulMatrix`"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:184
msgid "Generic helper functions"
msgstr "泛型辅助函数"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:186
msgid "`shape_of[M : @algebra.MatrixShape](matrix : M) -> (Int, Int)` returns an object's shape."
msgstr "`shape_of[M : @algebra.MatrixShape](matrix : M) -> (Int, Int)` 返回对象的形状。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:188
msgid "`matmul[M : @algebra.MatMulMatrix](left : M, right : M) -> M` dispatches matrix multiplication through the explicit multiplication capability."
msgstr "`matmul[M : @algebra.MatMulMatrix](left : M, right : M) -> M` 通过显式的乘法能力分发矩阵乘法。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:191
msgid "`transpose[M : @algebra.TransposeMatrix](matrix : M) -> M` dispatches closed transpose through the algebra trait."
msgstr "`transpose[M : @algebra.TransposeMatrix](matrix : M) -> M` 通过 algebra trait 分发闭合转置。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:196
msgid "This package implements outer `algebra` traits for the default backend wrapper types. It does not define new structure traits. Scalar-valued products and matrix-vector interactions described above remain backend methods rather than new `@algebra` traits, while norms, solves, and decompositions remain backend methods or future dedicated algorithm-layer APIs unless they can be represented as structure traits or closed operations."
msgstr "本包只为默认后端包装类型实现外层 `algebra` trait。它不定义新的结构 trait。这里记录的标量点积与矩阵-向量交互仍然属于后端方法，而不是新的 `@algebra` trait；范数、求解和分解也仍然属于后端方法，或未来专门的算法层 API。只有在它们能够表示成结构 trait 或同类型闭合运算时，才应提升到这一层。"

#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:3
msgid "API baseline for `Luna-Flow/linear-algebra/backends/openblas` in the current `0.4.7` repository state."
msgstr "本页记录当前 `0.4.7` 仓库中 `Luna-Flow/linear-algebra/backends/openblas` 的公开 API 基线。"

#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:8
msgid "`backends/openblas` provides owned native-only matrix and vector backend wrappers. Matrix multiplication delegates to OpenBLAS GEMM, while vector and matrix-vector helpers delegate to the matching BLAS kernels."
msgstr "`backends/openblas` 提供仓库自有、仅支持 `native` 的矩阵与向量后端包装类型。矩阵乘法委托给 OpenBLAS GEMM，向量和矩阵-向量辅助能力则委托给对应的 BLAS 内核。"

#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:12
msgid "This package is separate from `@immut.Matrix`. There is no runtime backend selector in `immut`; backend choice is now expressed by the concrete matrix type you use and the compilation target you build for."
msgstr "这个包与 `@immut.Matrix` 分离。`immut` 现在没有 runtime backend selector；后端选择体现在你显式使用的具体矩阵类型，以及你编译到的目标平台上。"

#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:16
msgid "Platform constraint"
msgstr "平台约束"

#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:18
msgid "Supported target: `native`"
msgstr "支持目标：`native`"

#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:19
msgid "Unsupported targets: `js`, `wasm`, `wasm-gc`"
msgstr "不支持目标：`js`、`wasm`、`wasm-gc`"

#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:20
msgid "Current repository link configuration searches both `/opt/homebrew/opt/openblas/include` and `/opt/homebrew/opt/openblas/lib` for Homebrew on macOS, and `/usr/include/x86_64-linux-gnu/openblas-pthread`, `/usr/include/openblas`, `/usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/openblas-pthread`, and `/usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu` for the default Ubuntu OpenBLAS package layout"
msgstr "当前仓库的链接配置会同时搜索 macOS Homebrew 的 `/opt/homebrew/opt/openblas/include` 与 `/opt/homebrew/opt/openblas/lib`，以及 Ubuntu 默认 OpenBLAS 包布局的 `/usr/include/x86_64-linux-gnu/openblas-pthread`、 `/usr/include/openblas`、 `/usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/openblas-pthread`、 `/usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu`"

#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:31
msgid "`BLASInnerType` is a backend-local trait implemented only for `Float` and `Double`."
msgstr "`BLASInnerType` 是后端局部 trait，目前只为 `Float` 与 `Double` 提供实现。"

#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:34
msgid "It owns the scalar-specific pieces required by the backend:"
msgstr "它负责封装这个后端需要的标量差异："

#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:36
msgid "`tolerance()` returns the comparison tolerance used by backend tests and result checks."
msgstr "`tolerance()` 返回测试与结果校验使用的容差。"

#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:38
msgid "`dot(length, left, right)` dispatches to `cblas_sdot` or `cblas_ddot`."
msgstr "`dot(length, left, right)` 调度到 `cblas_sdot` 或 `cblas_ddot`。"

#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:40
msgid "`scal(length, alpha, data)` dispatches to `cblas_sscal` or `cblas_dscal`."
msgstr "`scal(length, alpha, data)` 调度到 `cblas_sscal` 或 `cblas_dscal`。"

#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:42
msgid "`axpy(length, alpha, x, y)` dispatches to `cblas_saxpy` or `cblas_daxpy`."
msgstr "`axpy(length, alpha, x, y)` 调度到 `cblas_saxpy` 或 `cblas_daxpy`。"

#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:44
msgid "`gemm(m, n, k, left, right)` dispatches matrix multiplication to the matching OpenBLAS kernel: `cblas_sgemm` for `Float` and `cblas_dgemm` for `Double`."
msgstr "`gemm(m, n, k, left, right)` 调度到对应的 OpenBLAS 内核： `Float` 走 `cblas_sgemm`，`Double` 走 `cblas_dgemm`。"

#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:47
msgid "`gemv(row, col, matrix, vector)` dispatches matrix-vector multiplication to `cblas_sgemv` or `cblas_dgemv`."
msgstr "`gemv(row, col, matrix, vector)` 调度到 `cblas_sgemv` 或 `cblas_dgemv`。"

#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:50
msgid "`BlasMatrix[T]` and `BlasVector[T]` public construction and conversion APIs require `T : BLASInnerType`, so the backend does not expose a half-open “constructible for any `T` but only operable for some `T`” surface."
msgstr "`BlasMatrix[T]` 与 `BlasVector[T]` 的公开构造与转换 API 都要求 `T : BLASInnerType`，因此不会暴露 “任意 `T` 都能构造，但只有一部分 `T` 能真正参与运算”的半开放类型表面。"

#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:56
msgid "Owned native vector wrapper for the OpenBLAS backend."
msgstr "OpenBLAS 后端的自有 native 向量包装类型。"

#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:58
msgid "Constructors, conversions, and accessors"
msgstr "构造、互转与访问器"

#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:70
msgid "Trait coverage"
msgstr "trait 覆盖"

#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:72
msgid "`BlasVector[T]` currently implements:"
msgstr "`BlasVector[T]` 当前实现："

#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:79
msgid "It does **not** implement `@algebra.VecMulVector`. BLAS-style `scale`, `dot`, and `axpy` are exposed as backend methods rather than new structure traits."
msgstr "它**没有**实现 `@algebra.VecMulVector`。BLAS 风格的 `scale`、`dot`、`axpy` 仍然以 backend 方法形式公开，而不是新的结构 trait。"

#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:99
msgid "`BlasMatrix[T]` is the owned concrete backend matrix type for this package. Internally it stores:"
msgstr "`BlasMatrix[T]` 是该包自有的具体后端矩阵类型。它在内部保存："

#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:104
msgid "a contiguous `FixedArray[T]` buffer"
msgstr "连续存储的 `FixedArray[T]` buffer"

#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:106
msgid "The public mental model stays row-major. Layout details needed by OpenBLAS stay inside the backend implementation."
msgstr "公开心智模型保持为 row-major。调用 OpenBLAS 所需的布局细节被封装在后端内部，不会暴露给调用者。"

#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:109
msgid "Constructors and conversions"
msgstr "构造与互转"

#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:119
msgid "Accessors"
msgstr "访问器"

#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:127
msgid "`BlasMatrix::matvec(self, vector : BlasVector[T]) -> BlasVector[T]` multiplies the matrix by an OpenBLAS backend vector through GEMV."
msgstr "`BlasMatrix::matvec(self, vector : BlasVector[T]) -> BlasVector[T]` 通过 GEMV 计算矩阵与 OpenBLAS 后端向量的乘积。"

#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:132
msgid "`BlasMatrix[T]` currently implements:"
msgstr "`BlasMatrix[T]` 当前实现了："

#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:141
msgid "Behavior is split intentionally:"
msgstr "这些行为是有意分层的："

#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:143
msgid "`Mul` uses OpenBLAS GEMM through `BLASInnerType::gemm`."
msgstr "`Mul` 通过 `BLASInnerType::gemm` 调用 OpenBLAS GEMM。"

#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:144
msgid "`matvec` uses OpenBLAS GEMV through `BLASInnerType::gemv`."
msgstr "`matvec` 通过 `BLASInnerType::gemv` 调用 OpenBLAS GEMV。"

#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:145
msgid "`shape`, `transpose`, `+`, `-`, and unary `-` are implemented locally in MoonBit inside this backend package."
msgstr "`shape`、`transpose`、`+`、`-` 与一元 `-` 目前都在这个后端包里用 MoonBit 本地实现。"

#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:150
msgid "This package exposes an owned trait-compatible backend wrapper. It does not:"
msgstr "这个包公开的是自有的、兼容 trait 的后端包装层。它不会："

#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:152
msgid "add a runtime backend enum"
msgstr "添加运行时 backend enum"

#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:153
msgid "retrofit traits directly onto third-party OpenBLAS binding types"
msgstr "把 trait 直接加装到第三方 OpenBLAS 绑定类型上"

#: manual/api/backends/openblas.md:154
msgid "expose raw OpenBLAS handle types in the public API"
msgstr "在公开 API 中暴露原始 OpenBLAS 句柄类型"

#: manual/api/container.md:1
msgid "Container capability API"
msgstr "容器能力 API"

#: manual/api/container.md:3
msgid "The `container` package describes how generic code observes, constructs, and edits linear containers. It does not define mathematical laws or require a dense layout."
msgstr "`container` 包描述泛型代码如何观察、构造和编辑线性容器，不规定数学定律、稠密布局或所有权模型。"

#: manual/api/container.md:9
msgid "`container` is an experimental feature. Its read/build model is available for real interoperability trials, while operation-record fields, edit capabilities, error contracts, and generic algorithm signatures may still change incompatibly. Use it as a checked data-interchange and structural transformation layer, not as a compatibility-stable public boundary or a high-performance numerical kernel API."
msgstr "`container` 是实验性功能。它的 read/build 模型已经可以用于真实的互操作试验，但操作记录字段、编辑能力、错误契约和泛型算法签名仍可能发生不兼容变更。应把它用于带检查的数据交换和结构转换，而不是兼容性稳定的公开边界或高性能数值计算内核 API。"

#: manual/api/container.md:16
msgid "External library authors should use the capability-level guidance in the [ecosystem integration guide](../integration/container.md) before selecting adapters."
msgstr "外部库作者在选择适配器之前，应先参考[生态接入指南](../integration/container.md)中按能力级别给出的建议。"

#: manual/api/container.md:19
msgid "Capability records"
msgstr "能力记录"

#: manual/api/container.md:21
msgid "`VectorReadOps[V, T]`: `length` and checked `get`."
msgstr "`VectorReadOps[V, T]`：长度和受检 `get`。"

#: manual/api/container.md:22
msgid "`MatrixReadOps[M, T]`: `shape` and checked `get`."
msgstr "`MatrixReadOps[M, T]`：形状和受检 `get`。"

#: manual/api/container.md:23
msgid "`VectorBuildOps[V, T]`: checked `tabulate` construction."
msgstr "`VectorBuildOps[V, T]`：受检 `tabulate` 构造。"

#: manual/api/container.md:24
msgid "`MatrixBuildOps[M, T]`: checked row/column `tabulate` construction."
msgstr "`MatrixBuildOps[M, T]`：按行列坐标执行的受检 `tabulate` 构造。"

#: manual/api/container.md:25
msgid "`VectorPersistentEditOps[V, T]` and `MatrixPersistentEditOps[M, T]`: checked replacement returning a new value."
msgstr "`VectorPersistentEditOps[V, T]` 与 `MatrixPersistentEditOps[M, T]`：受检替换，返回新值。"

#: manual/api/container.md:27
msgid "`VectorMutableEditOps[V, T]` and `MatrixMutableEditOps[M, T]`: checked in-place replacement returning `Result[Unit, LinearAlgebraError]`."
msgstr "`VectorMutableEditOps[V, T]` 与 `MatrixMutableEditOps[M, T]`：受检的原地替换，返回 `Result[Unit, LinearAlgebraError]`。"

#: manual/api/container.md:30
msgid "Each record has a `new` constructor. Read and edit operations must return `IndexOutOfBounds` for invalid coordinates. Builders must return `NegativeDimension` rather than calling an initializer for an invalid shape."
msgstr "每个记录都提供 `new` 构造函数。非法坐标返回 `IndexOutOfBounds`，负形状返回 `NegativeDimension`。"

#: manual/api/container.md:34
msgid "Generic algorithms"
msgstr "泛型算法"

#: manual/api/container.md:36
msgid "`vector_map` and `matrix_map` may change the container and scalar types."
msgstr "`vector_map` 与 `matrix_map` 可以改变容器类型和标量类型。"

#: manual/api/container.md:37
msgid "`vector_convert` and `matrix_convert` preserve the scalar type while changing storage backends."
msgstr "`vector_convert` 与 `matrix_convert` 在切换存储后端的同时保持标量类型不变。"

#: manual/api/container.md:39
msgid "`matrix_transpose` may produce a different target matrix type."
msgstr "`matrix_transpose` 可以生成不同类型的目标矩阵。"

#: manual/api/container.md:41
msgid "The algorithms retain exact degenerate shapes such as `0xN` and `Nx0`. They read into a temporary linear buffer before construction, so a checked read failure cannot leave a partially constructed target."
msgstr "这些算法会精确保留 `0xN` 与 `Nx0` 等退化形状。它们在构造之前先读入一个临时线性缓冲区，因此受检读取失败不会留下构造了一半的目标。"

#: manual/api/container.md:45
msgid "Repository adapters"
msgstr "仓库适配器"

#: manual/api/container.md:47
msgid "The `container/adapters` package provides factories for `immut.Vector`, `immut.Matrix`, `mutable.Vector`, `mutable.Matrix`, the four default dense wrappers, mutable row/column views, and mutable transpose views. Views provide read and mutable-edit capabilities but no build capability."
msgstr "`container/adapters` 包为 `immut.Vector`、`immut.Matrix`、`mutable.Vector`、`mutable.Matrix`、四个默认稠密包装类型、可变行/列视图以及可变转置视图提供 factory。视图提供 read 与可变编辑能力，但不提供 build 能力。"

#: manual/api/container.md:52
msgid "The native-only OpenBLAS package provides `blas_vector_read_ops`, `blas_vector_build_ops`, `blas_matrix_read_ops`, and `blas_matrix_build_ops`. It intentionally does not advertise persistent editing."
msgstr "仅支持 native 的 OpenBLAS 包提供 `blas_vector_read_ops`、`blas_vector_build_ops`、`blas_matrix_read_ops` 与 `blas_matrix_build_ops`，并有意不提供持久编辑。"

#: manual/api/error.md:3
msgid "API baseline for `Luna-Flow/linear-algebra/error` in the current `0.4.7` repository state."
msgstr "本页记录当前 `0.4.7` 仓库中 `Luna-Flow/linear-algebra/error` 的公开 API 基线。"

#: manual/api/error.md:8
msgid "`error` provides the structured error type used by checked linear-algebra APIs. The package lets callers distinguish shape errors, invalid domains, singular matrices, non-convergence, and arithmetic failures without parsing abort messages."
msgstr "`error` 提供带检查线性代数 API 共用的结构化错误类型。调用者可以根据错误种类区分形状错误、非法输入域、奇异矩阵、非收敛，以及底层算术错误，而不需要解析 abort 文本。"

#: manual/api/error.md:27
msgid "The enum classifies the failure. `ArithmeticFailure` wraps the upstream `Luna-Flow/arithmetic.ArithmeticError`."
msgstr "该枚举用来表示失败类型。`ArithmeticFailure` 会携带上游 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic.ArithmeticError`。"

#: manual/api/error.md:41
msgid "The struct stores a machine-readable kind and a human-readable message."
msgstr "该结构同时保存机器可判断的错误种类和给人阅读的消息。"

#: manual/api/error.md:43
msgid "Constructors"
msgstr "构造函数"

#: manual/api/error.md:57
msgid "Predicates"
msgstr "判断方法"

#: manual/api/error.md:71
msgid "These methods are intended for matching common checked API failures without destructuring the error value."
msgstr "这些方法用于处理带检查 API 的常见错误，不需要调用者拆开错误值。"

#: manual/api/error.md:74
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "使用示例"

#: manual/api/error.md:90
msgid "This package defines error values only. It does not implement matrix algorithms, numeric recovery strategies, logging, or formatting policy."
msgstr "本包只定义错误值，不实现矩阵算法、数值恢复策略、日志或格式化策略。"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:3
msgid "API baseline for `@immut.Matrix` in the current `0.4.7` repository state."
msgstr "本页记录 `@immut.Matrix` 在当前 `0.4.7` 仓库状态下的 API 基线。"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:5
#: manual/api/immut/vector.md:5
#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:7
#: manual/api/mutable/vector.md:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概览"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:7
msgid "`@immut.Matrix` is the repository's value-oriented matrix type."
msgstr "`@immut.Matrix` 是仓库里的值语义矩阵类型。"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:8
msgid "Operations such as `set`, `swap_rows`, and `swap_cols` return a new matrix."
msgstr "`set`、`swap_rows`、`swap_cols` 等操作都会返回新矩阵。"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:9
msgid "Matrix storage is row-major and backed by the immutable vector implementation."
msgstr "行列式数据按行优先顺序存储，底层使用 immutable vector 实现。"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:10
msgid "Public indexed access is strict about bounds. `m[row][col]` and `set(row, col, value)` abort on out-of-range indices, including `0xN` and `Nx0` edge shapes."
msgstr "公开索引访问采用严格边界检查。`m[row][col]` 和 `set(row, col, value)` 在越界时都会中止，包括 `0xN` 和 `Nx0` 边界形状。"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:11
msgid "`swap_rows(i, i)` and `swap_cols(i, i)` are no-op operations that return the original value unchanged."
msgstr "`swap_rows(i, i)` 与 `swap_cols(i, i)` 不改变矩阵，直接返回原值。"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:13
#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:15
msgid "Core matrix API"
msgstr "核心 API"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:15
msgid "`Matrix::make(row, col, f)` Creates a matrix from a generator function. Negative dimensions abort."
msgstr "`Matrix::make(row, col, f)` 用生成函数创建矩阵。负维度会中止。"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:17
msgid "`Matrix::new(row, col, elem)` Creates a matrix filled with `elem`. Negative dimensions abort."
msgstr "`Matrix::new(row, col, elem)` 创建所有元素都为 `elem` 的矩阵。负维度会中止。"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:19
#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:21
msgid "`Matrix::from_2d_array(arr)` Creates a matrix from a rectangular 2D array. Ragged input aborts."
msgstr "`Matrix::from_2d_array(arr)` 从矩形二维数组构造矩阵。行长不一致的输入会中止。"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:21
msgid "`Matrix::from_array(row, col, data)` Builds a matrix from a flat immutable vector in row-major order. Negative dimensions or wrong element count abort."
msgstr "`Matrix::from_array(row, col, data)` 从按行优先排列的不可变向量构造矩阵。负维度或元素数量不匹配会中止。"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:23
#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:25
msgid "`row()` / `col()` Return the stored shape."
msgstr "`row()` / `col()` 返回保存的形状。"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:25
msgid "`m[row][col]` Read-only convenience indexing. Row and column bounds are checked explicitly."
msgstr "`m[row][col]` 只读便捷索引语法。会显式检查行和列边界。"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:27
msgid "`set(row, col, elem)` Returns a new matrix with one replaced element. Bounds are checked explicitly."
msgstr "`set(row, col, elem)` 返回只替换一个元素的新矩阵。边界会显式检查。"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:29
msgid "`map`, `mapi` Return transformed matrices without mutating the original."
msgstr "`map`, `mapi` 返回转换后的新矩阵，不修改原值。"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:31
msgid "`transpose()` Returns the materialized transpose."
msgstr "`transpose()` 返回实化后的转置矩阵。"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:33
msgid "`horizontal_combine`, `vertical_combine` Concatenate matrices with compatible shapes."
msgstr "`horizontal_combine`, `vertical_combine` 拼接形状兼容的矩阵。"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:35
msgid "`iter`, `iter_row`, `iter_col`, `to_array`, `to_2d_array` Expose row-major iteration and materialized conversions. Row/column iterators abort on invalid indices."
msgstr "`iter`, `iter_row`, `iter_col`, `to_array`, `to_2d_array` 提供行优先迭代与物化转换。行/列迭代器在非法索引下会中止。"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:38
msgid "Algebraic operations"
msgstr "代数操作"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:40
msgid "`+`, `-`, `*` Addition, subtraction, and matrix multiplication. Shape mismatch aborts."
msgstr "`+`, `-`, `*` 加法、减法和矩阵乘法。形状不匹配会中止。"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:42
msgid "`matmul(rhs)`, `trace()`, `determinant()`, `pow(power)` Checked APIs return `Result[..., LinearAlgebraError]` for shape or exponent failures."
msgstr "`matmul(rhs)`, `trace()`, `determinant()`, `pow(power)` 这些带检查的 API 会在形状或指数错误时返回 `Result[..., LinearAlgebraError]`。"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:44
msgid "`unchecked_matmul(rhs)`, `unchecked_trace()`, `unchecked_determinant()`, `unchecked_pow(power)` Preserve the old aborting behavior for callers that explicitly want unchecked operations."
msgstr "`unchecked_matmul(rhs)`, `unchecked_trace()`, `unchecked_determinant()`, `unchecked_pow(power)` 保留旧的直接 abort 行为，供明确需要 unchecked 操作的调用方使用。"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:46
#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:65
msgid "`scale(cst)`, `add_constant(cst)`, unary `-` Element-wise scalar transforms."
msgstr "`scale(cst)`, `add_constant(cst)`, 单目 `-` 逐元素的标量变换。"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:48
msgid "`identity(size)` Creates an identity matrix. Negative `size` aborts."
msgstr "`identity(size)` 创建单位矩阵。负 `size` 会中止。"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:50
msgid "`trace()` Checked sum of diagonal entries. Requires a square matrix."
msgstr "`trace()` 带检查的对角线求和，要求方阵。"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:52
msgid "`determinant()` Checked determinant of a square matrix. Uses the current repository implementation with small-size specializations and elimination for larger inputs."
msgstr "`determinant()` 带检查的方阵行列式。当前实现对小尺寸使用特化，对更大输入使用消元路径。"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:54
#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:69
msgid "`pow(power)` Checked square-matrix exponentiation for non-negative integer powers."
msgstr "`pow(power)` 带检查的方阵非负整数幂。"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:56
msgid "`null()`, `is_square()` Shape and zero-matrix helpers."
msgstr "`null()`, `is_square()` 零矩阵与形状判断辅助。"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:58
msgid "`adjoint()` Conjugate transpose for element types implementing `Conjugate`."
msgstr "`adjoint()` 对实现了 `Conjugate` 的元素类型返回共轭转置。"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:60
msgid "`swap_rows(r1, r2)`, `swap_cols(c1, c2)` Return a new matrix with the chosen rows or columns swapped. Out-of-range indices abort; same-index swaps leave the value unchanged."
msgstr "`swap_rows(r1, r2)`, `swap_cols(c1, c2)` 返回交换指定行或列后的新矩阵。越界会中止；相同索引不改变矩阵。"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:65
msgid "`MatrixFn` is the lazy functional companion to `Matrix`."
msgstr "`MatrixFn` 是 `Matrix` 的惰性函数式版本。"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:66
msgid "It follows the same non-negative-dimension rule."
msgstr "它与 `Matrix` 共享非负维度规则。"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:67
msgid "`MatrixFn::from_2d_array([])` yields a `0x0` matrix."
msgstr "`MatrixFn::from_2d_array([])` 返回 `0x0`。"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:68
msgid "`MatrixFn::from_2d_array([[], ...])` preserves zero-column shapes."
msgstr "`MatrixFn::from_2d_array([[], ...])` 保留零列形状。"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:69
msgid "Ragged input is rejected eagerly."
msgstr "行长不一致的输入会被及早拒绝。"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:70
msgid "Row access validates the row immediately, and element access validates the column through the functional backing contract."
msgstr "行访问会立即校验行索引，元素访问则通过函数式后端契约校验列索引。"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:72
msgid "Important methods:"
msgstr "主要方法："

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:80
#: manual/api/immut/vector.md:56
#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:100
#: manual/api/mutable/vector.md:60
msgid "Guidance"
msgstr "使用建议"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:82
msgid "For shared algebraic behavior, prefer the capability traits and the `backends/default` wrapper types. `@immut.Matrix` is one dense implementation used by the default backend, not the semantic center of the ecosystem."
msgstr "对共享代数行为来说，优先依赖 capability traits 和 `backends/default` 包装类型。`@immut.Matrix` 只是默认后端使用的一种稠密实现，不是整个生态的语义中心。"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:85
msgid "The mutable package intentionally exposes extra execution-oriented APIs such as views and in-place updates; those should not be projected back onto `immut`."
msgstr "`mutable` 包会额外暴露视图和原地更新等执行导向 API，不应把这些能力反向投射到 `immut` 上。"

#: manual/api/immut/matrix.md:86
msgid "`backends/default.ImmutableDenseMatrix` is a wrapper around this concrete implementation. If you want the trait-oriented default backend entry point, see [the `backends/default` API](../backends/default.md)."
msgstr "`backends/default.ImmutableDenseMatrix` 包装的就是这个 concrete 实现。如果你要从 trait 导向的默认后端入口进入，请看 [backends/default API](../backends/default.md)。"

#: manual/api/immut/vector.md:3
msgid "API baseline for `@immut.Vector` in the current `0.4.7` repository state."
msgstr "本页记录 `@immut.Vector` 在当前 `0.4.7` 仓库状态下的 API 基线。"

#: manual/api/immut/vector.md:7
msgid "`@immut.Vector` is the repository's value-oriented vector type."
msgstr "`@immut.Vector` 是仓库里的值语义向量类型。"

#: manual/api/immut/vector.md:8
msgid "The public type is also exported under the package alias `VecLib[T]`."
msgstr "这个公开类型同时以包别名 `VecLib[T]` 导出。"

#: manual/api/immut/vector.md:9
msgid "Storage is backed by the immutable core vector alias `VecCore[T]`."
msgstr "底层存储使用不可变核心向量别名 `VecCore[T]`。"

#: manual/api/immut/vector.md:10
msgid "Operations such as `set`, `map`, `left_scale`, and `right_scale` always return a new vector."
msgstr "`set`、`map`、`left_scale`、`right_scale` 等操作始终返回新向量。"

#: manual/api/immut/vector.md:12
msgid "The package does not expose in-place updates or a dot-product helper."
msgstr "本包不提供原地更新，也不提供公开的 `dot()` 辅助函数。"

#: manual/api/immut/vector.md:14
#: manual/api/mutable/vector.md:13
msgid "Core API"
msgstr "核心 API"

#: manual/api/immut/vector.md:16
msgid "`Vector::from_array(arr)` Builds a vector from a mutable `Array[T]`."
msgstr "`Vector::from_array(arr)` 从可变 `Array[T]` 构造向量。"

#: manual/api/immut/vector.md:18
msgid "`Vector::make(n, elem)` / `Vector::makei(n, f)` Create a constant vector or generate one from indices."
msgstr "`Vector::make(n, elem)` / `Vector::makei(n, f)` 创建常量向量，或按索引生成向量。"

#: manual/api/immut/vector.md:20
#: manual/api/mutable/vector.md:17
msgid "`length()` Returns the vector length."
msgstr "`length()` 返回向量长度。"

#: manual/api/immut/vector.md:22
msgid "`v[i]` Reads one element. Bounds follow the underlying immutable vector contract."
msgstr "`v[i]` 读取单个元素。边界行为遵循底层不可变向量契约。"

#: manual/api/immut/vector.md:24
msgid "`set(i, x)` Returns a new vector with one replaced element."
msgstr "`set(i, x)` 返回一个在指定位置替换过元素的新向量。"

#: manual/api/immut/vector.md:26
msgid "`iter()` Exposes an iterator over the elements in order."
msgstr "`iter()` 按顺序遍历向量元素。"

#: manual/api/immut/vector.md:29
msgid "Value transforms"
msgstr "值变换"

#: manual/api/immut/vector.md:31
msgid "`map(f)` / `zip_with(other, f)` Return transformed vectors without mutating the original."
msgstr "`map(f)` / `zip_with(other, f)` 返回变换后的新向量，不修改原值。"

#: manual/api/immut/vector.md:33
msgid "`add_constant(cst)` Adds the same scalar to every element."
msgstr "`add_constant(cst)` 给每个元素加上同一个标量。"

#: manual/api/immut/vector.md:35
msgid "`left_scale(scalar)` / `right_scale(scalar)` Apply scalar multiplication and return a new vector."
msgstr "`left_scale(scalar)` / `right_scale(scalar)` 返回缩放后的新向量。"

#: manual/api/immut/vector.md:37
#: manual/api/mutable/vector.md:34
msgid "`lerp(other, alpha)` Computes `(1 - alpha) * self + alpha * other`."
msgstr "`lerp(other, alpha)` 计算 `(1 - alpha) * self + alpha * other`。"

#: manual/api/immut/vector.md:39
#: manual/api/mutable/vector.md:36
msgid "`+`, `*`, unary `-` Element-wise addition, Hadamard multiplication, and negation."
msgstr "`+`、`*`、一元 `-` 分别表示按元素加法、Hadamard 乘法和取负。"

#: manual/api/immut/vector.md:41
msgid "`lin_comb(scalar_a, self, scalar_b, other)` Top-level helper for a two-vector linear combination."
msgstr "`lin_comb(scalar_a, self, scalar_b, other)` 顶层辅助函数，用于两个向量的线性组合。"

#: manual/api/immut/vector.md:44
msgid "Length mismatches for shared element-wise operations follow the underlying vector contract and abort."
msgstr "共享的按元素操作如果长度不一致，会按底层向量契约直接中止。"

#: manual/api/immut/vector.md:47
msgid "Matrix conversions"
msgstr "矩阵转换"

#: manual/api/immut/vector.md:49
msgid "`to_col_matrix()` / `to_row_matrix()` Materialize the vector as an `n x 1` or `1 x n` matrix."
msgstr "`to_col_matrix()` / `to_row_matrix()` 把向量物化为 `n x 1` 或 `1 x n` 矩阵。"

#: manual/api/immut/vector.md:51
#: manual/api/mutable/vector.md:55
msgid "`scaled_matrix()` Builds a diagonal matrix with the vector on the main diagonal."
msgstr "`scaled_matrix()` 创建以该向量为主对角线的对角矩阵。"

#: manual/api/immut/vector.md:53
#: manual/api/mutable/vector.md:57
msgid "`tensor_product(other)` Computes the outer product and returns a matrix."
msgstr "`tensor_product(other)` 计算外积并返回矩阵。"

#: manual/api/immut/vector.md:58
msgid "Use `@immut.Vector` when downstream code benefits from explicit value semantics."
msgstr "当下游代码需要明确的值语义时，优先使用 `@immut.Vector`。"

#: manual/api/immut/vector.md:60
msgid "Use `@mutable.Vector` instead when you need in-place updates or the public `dot()` helper."
msgstr "如果你需要原地更新或公开的 `dot()` 辅助函数，请改用 `@mutable.Vector`。"

#: manual/api/immut/vector.md:62
msgid "`backends/default.ImmutableDenseVector` is a wrapper around this concrete implementation. If you want the trait-oriented default backend entry point, see [the `backends/default` API](../backends/default.md)."
msgstr "`backends/default.ImmutableDenseVector` 包装的就是这个 concrete 实现。如果你要从 trait 导向的默认后端入口进入，请看 [backends/default API](../backends/default.md)。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:3
msgid "API baseline for `@mutable.Matrix` in the current `0.4.7` repository state. Square-root-dependent APIs use `Luna-Flow/arithmetic.Sqrt`; `Tolerance` remains defined by `mutable`."
msgstr "本页记录 `@mutable.Matrix` 在当前 `0.4.7` 仓库状态下的 API 基线。依赖平方根的 API 使用 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic.Sqrt`；`Tolerance` 仍由 `mutable` 定义。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:9
msgid "`@mutable.Matrix` is the repository's execution-oriented matrix type."
msgstr "`@mutable.Matrix` 是仓库里的执行导向矩阵类型。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:10
msgid "`set`, `swap_rows`, `swap_cols`, `map_inplace`, row/column view updates, and transpose updates modify the underlying matrix in place."
msgstr "`set`、`swap_rows`、`swap_cols`、`map_inplace`、行/列视图更新以及转置视图更新，都会直接修改底层矩阵。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:11
msgid "Public storage is a flat row-major `Array[T]` across backends. Backend-specific files differ in execution tuning, not in the public matrix model."
msgstr "公开存储模型在所有后端上都是按行优先的扁平 `Array[T]`。后端文件之间的差异主要是执行优化，而不是公开矩阵模型。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:12
msgid "Public access is strict about bounds. `get`, `set`, `m[row][col]`, `row_view`, `col_view`, extraction helpers, iterators, and transpose-view access reject out-of-range indices consistently, including zero-row and zero-column edge shapes."
msgstr "公开访问采用严格边界检查。`get`、`set`、`m[row][col]`、`row_view`、`col_view`、提取辅助函数、迭代器和转置视图访问，都会一致地拒绝越界索引，包括 `0xN` 和 `Nx0` 边界形状。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:13
msgid "`swap_rows(i, i)` and `swap_cols(i, i)` leave the matrix unchanged. Out-of-range row or column indices abort explicitly instead of relying on accidental storage access."
msgstr "`swap_rows(i, i)` 与 `swap_cols(i, i)` 不改变矩阵。越界索引会显式中止，而不是依赖底层存储“恰好访问出错”。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:17
msgid "`Matrix::make(row, col, f)` Builds a matrix from a generator function. Negative dimensions abort."
msgstr "`Matrix::make(row, col, f)` 用生成函数构造矩阵。负维度会中止。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:19
msgid "`Matrix::new(row, col, elem)` Builds a matrix filled with `elem`. Negative dimensions abort."
msgstr "`Matrix::new(row, col, elem)` 构造所有元素都为 `elem` 的矩阵。负维度会中止。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:23
msgid "`Matrix::from_array(row, col, data)` Uses a flat row-major array as matrix storage. Negative dimensions or wrong element count abort."
msgstr "`Matrix::from_array(row, col, data)` 将按行优先排列的一维数组按指定形状作为矩阵。负维度或元素数量不匹配会中止。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:27
msgid "`get(row, col)` / `set(row, col, elem)` Fast random access with explicit bounds checks."
msgstr "`get(row, col)` / `set(row, col, elem)` 带显式边界检查的快速随机访问。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:29
msgid "`m[row][col]` Convenience syntax backed by `Lens[T]`. It is valid for read and write, but repeated bulk work should prefer `row_view`, `col_view`, or the dedicated row/column helpers."
msgstr "`m[row][col]` 基于 `Lens[T]` 的便捷语法。可以读写，但在重复批量操作时应优先使用 `row_view`、`col_view` 或专用辅助函数。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:31
msgid "`copy()` Deep-copies the matrix."
msgstr "`copy()` 深拷贝矩阵。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:33
msgid "`map`, `mapi` Return a transformed matrix."
msgstr "`map`, `mapi` 返回转换后的新矩阵。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:35
msgid "`map_inplace`, `map_row_inplace`, `map_col_inplace` Apply in-place transforms."
msgstr "`map_inplace`, `map_row_inplace`, `map_col_inplace` 原地变换。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:37
msgid "`each`, `eachi`, `each_row_col`, `each_row`, `each_col`, `eachi_row`, `eachi_col` Traversal helpers."
msgstr "`each`, `eachi`, `each_row_col`, `each_row`, `each_col`, `eachi_row`, `eachi_col` 遍历辅助函数。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:39
msgid "`iter`, `iter_row`, `iter_col` Iterators with checked row/column bounds."
msgstr "`iter`, `iter_row`, `iter_col` 带边界检查的迭代器。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:41
msgid "`row_to_array`, `col_to_array`, `row_to_vector`, `col_to_vector`, `to_array`, `to_2d_array`, `to_vector` Materialization helpers with checked indices where applicable."
msgstr "`row_to_array`, `col_to_array`, `row_to_vector`, `col_to_vector`, `to_array`, `to_2d_array`, `to_vector` 物化辅助函数；需要索引时会做校验。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:43
msgid "`transpose()` Returns a materialized transpose."
msgstr "`transpose()` 返回物化后的转置矩阵。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:45
msgid "`to_transpose()` Returns a live transpose view."
msgstr "`to_transpose()` 返回一个与底层矩阵保持连接的转置视图。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:47
msgid "`horizontal_combine`, `vertical_combine` Concatenate compatible matrices."
msgstr "`horizontal_combine`, `vertical_combine` 拼接形状兼容的矩阵。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:50
msgid "Views and transpose"
msgstr "视图与转置"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:52
msgid "`row_view(row)` / `col_view(col)` Return live views into the underlying matrix."
msgstr "`row_view(row)` / `col_view(col)` 返回与底层矩阵保持连接的视图。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:54
msgid "`RowView` and `ColView` Expose `get`, `set`, `iter`, `each`, `eachi`, `map_inplace`, `to_array`, and `to_vector`."
msgstr "`RowView` 与 `ColView` 暴露 `get`、`set`、`iter`、`each`、`eachi`、`map_inplace`、`to_array`、`to_vector`。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:56
msgid "`Transpose` Exposes the same matrix-like surface over a live transposed view."
msgstr "`Transpose` 在转置视图上提供接近矩阵的 API 表面。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:58
msgid "`Transpose::swap_rows` and `Transpose::swap_cols` Delegate to the underlying matrix with the same strict bounds semantics."
msgstr "`Transpose::swap_rows` / `Transpose::swap_cols` 委托到底层矩阵，并共享同样严格的边界语义。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:61
msgid "Algebraic and numeric API"
msgstr "代数与数值 API"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:63
msgid "`+`, `-`, `*` Matrix addition, subtraction, and multiplication."
msgstr "`+`, `-`, `*` 矩阵加法、减法和乘法。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:67
msgid "`identity(size)` Identity matrix constructor. Negative `size` aborts."
msgstr "`identity(size)` 单位矩阵构造器。负 `size` 会中止。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:71
msgid "`matrix_power(n)` Checked public wrapper around `pow(n)`."
msgstr "`matrix_power(n)` `pow(n)` 的带检查公开别名。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:73
msgid "`trace()` Checked sum of diagonal entries. Requires a square matrix and returns `Result[..., LinearAlgebraError]`."
msgstr "`trace()` 带检查的对角线求和。要求方阵，并返回 `Result[..., LinearAlgebraError]`。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:75
msgid "`determinant()` Checked determinant of a square matrix."
msgstr "`determinant()` 带检查的方阵行列式。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:77
msgid "`inverse()`, `is_invertible()` Checked inversion helpers for square matrices. Singular inverse returns `Err`."
msgstr "`inverse()`, `is_invertible()` 带检查的逆矩阵相关辅助函数。奇异矩阵求逆返回 `Err`。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:79
msgid "`mul_vec(vector)` Checked matrix-vector multiplication. Shape mismatch returns `Err`."
msgstr "`mul_vec(vector)` 带检查的矩阵向量乘法。形状不匹配时返回 `Err`。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:81
msgid "`mean()`, `variance()`, `std_dev()`, `max_element()`, `min_element()` Checked aggregate helpers. Empty matrices return `Err`."
msgstr "`mean()`, `variance()`, `std_dev()`, `max_element()`, `min_element()` 带检查的聚合辅助函数。空矩阵返回 `Err`。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:83
msgid "`unchecked_trace()`, `unchecked_determinant()`, `unchecked_inverse()`, `unchecked_is_invertible()`, `unchecked_pow()`, `unchecked_matrix_power()`, `unchecked_mul_vec()`, `unchecked_mean()`, `unchecked_variance()`, `unchecked_std_dev()`, `unchecked_max_element()`, `unchecked_min_element()` Preserve the old aborting or `Option`-returning behavior."
msgstr "`unchecked_trace()`, `unchecked_determinant()`, `unchecked_inverse()`, `unchecked_is_invertible()`, `unchecked_pow()`, `unchecked_matrix_power()`, `unchecked_mul_vec()`, `unchecked_mean()`, `unchecked_variance()`, `unchecked_std_dev()`, `unchecked_max_element()`, `unchecked_min_element()` 保留旧的 abort 或 `Option` 返回行为。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:85
msgid "`rank()` Rank computed through the current repository algorithm."
msgstr "`rank()` 按当前仓库算法计算矩阵的秩。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:87
msgid "`reduce_row_elimination()` In-place-style row reduction on the mutable matrix value."
msgstr "`reduce_row_elimination()` 在可变矩阵值上执行行消元。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:89
msgid "`cholesky_decomposition()` Cholesky factorization for supported numeric inputs."
msgstr "`cholesky_decomposition()` 对支持的数值输入执行 Cholesky 分解。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:91
msgid "`eigen()`, `power_method()` Public eigen-related APIs for supported numeric cases. The specialized 2x2 helper used by the implementation is not part of the public package interface."
msgstr "`eigen()`, `power_method()` 当前公开的特征值相关 API。实现内部使用的 2x2 特化辅助函数不是公开接口。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:95
msgid "`is_square()`, `null()`, `is_symmetric()`, `is_positive_definite()` Structural and numeric predicates."
msgstr "`is_square()`, `null()`, `is_symmetric()`, `is_positive_definite()` 结构与数值判定辅助。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:97
msgid "`frobenius_norm()` Non-checked aggregate numeric helper for supported element types."
msgstr "`frobenius_norm()` 面向支持元素类型的非检查式聚合辅助函数。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:102
msgid "Backends are expected to expose the same public semantics. The repository currently keeps separate kernel files for `native`, `js`, `wasm`, and `wasm-gc`, so tests and documentation should be read as backend-invariant unless a note says otherwise."
msgstr "各后端应暴露相同的公开语义。当前仓库仍保留 `native`、`js`、`wasm`、`wasm-gc` 四套内核文件，但除非特别说明，文档与测试都按后端无关的公开行为来理解。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:103
msgid "For code shared across `immut` and `mutable`, rely on the common algebraic surface and not on identical mutation semantics."
msgstr "当你编写同时适用于 `immut` 和 `mutable` 的代码时，应依赖它们共享的代数 API，而不是假设修改语义也完全相同。"

#: manual/api/mutable/matrix.md:104
msgid "`backends/default.DenseMatrix` is a wrapper around this concrete implementation. If you want the trait-oriented default backend entry point, see [the `backends/default` API](../backends/default.md)."
msgstr "`backends/default.DenseMatrix` 包装的就是这个 concrete 实现。如果你要从 trait 导向的默认后端入口进入，请看 [backends/default API](../backends/default.md)。"

#: manual/api/mutable/vector.md:3
msgid "API baseline for `@mutable.Vector` in the current `0.4.7` repository state."
msgstr "本页记录 `@mutable.Vector` 在当前 `0.4.7` 仓库状态下的 API 基线。"

#: manual/api/mutable/vector.md:7
msgid "`@mutable.Vector` is the repository's mutation-oriented vector type."
msgstr "`@mutable.Vector` 是仓库里的可变向量类型。"

#: manual/api/mutable/vector.md:8
msgid "Storage is a wrapped `Array[T]`, so indexed writes update the underlying mutable buffer directly."
msgstr "底层存储是包装后的 `Array[T]`，因此索引写入会直接更新内部缓冲区。"

#: manual/api/mutable/vector.md:10
msgid "Even in this package, many algebraic helpers still return fresh vectors so callers can choose between mutation and value-producing transforms."
msgstr "即使在这个包里，很多代数辅助函数仍然会返回新向量，便于调用方在“原地修改”和“返回新值”之间显式选择。"

#: manual/api/mutable/vector.md:15
msgid "`Vector::from_array(arr)` / `Vector::make(n, elem)` / `Vector::makei(n, f)` Construct vectors from existing data, a repeated value, or an index function."
msgstr "`Vector::from_array(arr)` / `Vector::make(n, elem)` / `Vector::makei(n, f)` 分别用于从现有数据、重复值或索引函数构造向量。"

#: manual/api/mutable/vector.md:19
msgid "`v[i]` / `v[i] = x` Read and write one element. Bounds follow `Array[T]` behavior."
msgstr "`v[i]` / `v[i] = x` 读取或写入单个元素。边界行为遵循 `Array[T]`。"

#: manual/api/mutable/vector.md:21
msgid "`copy()` Returns a deep copy of the vector."
msgstr "`copy()` 返回当前向量的深拷贝。"

#: manual/api/mutable/vector.md:23
msgid "`iter()` Exposes an iterator over the current elements."
msgstr "`iter()` 按当前顺序遍历元素。"

#: manual/api/mutable/vector.md:26
msgid "Value-producing helpers"
msgstr "返回新向量的辅助函数"

#: manual/api/mutable/vector.md:28
msgid "`map(f)` / `zip_with(other, f)` Return a transformed vector without mutating `self`."
msgstr "`map(f)` / `zip_with(other, f)` 返回变换后的新向量，不修改 `self`。"

#: manual/api/mutable/vector.md:30
msgid "`add_constant(cst)` Adds the same scalar to each element."
msgstr "`add_constant(cst)` 给每个元素加上同一个标量。"

#: manual/api/mutable/vector.md:32
msgid "`left_scale(scalar)` / `right_scale(scalar)` Return scaled vectors."
msgstr "`left_scale(scalar)` / `right_scale(scalar)` 返回缩放后的新向量。"

#: manual/api/mutable/vector.md:39
msgid "In-place helpers"
msgstr "原地辅助函数"

#: manual/api/mutable/vector.md:41
msgid "`map_inplace(f)` Rewrites every element in place."
msgstr "`map_inplace(f)` 原地改写所有元素。"

#: manual/api/mutable/vector.md:43
msgid "`left_scale_inplace(scalar)` / `right_scale_inplace(scalar)` Apply scalar multiplication in place."
msgstr "`left_scale_inplace(scalar)` / `right_scale_inplace(scalar)` 原地执行标量缩放。"

#: manual/api/mutable/vector.md:46
msgid "Scalar and matrix helpers"
msgstr "标量与矩阵辅助函数"

#: manual/api/mutable/vector.md:48
msgid "`dot(other)` Computes the dot product. Length mismatch aborts."
msgstr "`dot(other)` 计算点积。长度不一致时会直接中止。"

#: manual/api/mutable/vector.md:50
msgid "`lin_comb(weights, vectors)` Top-level helper that builds one vector from weighted input vectors. Empty inputs, mismatched counts, or mismatched vector lengths abort."
msgstr "`lin_comb(weights, vectors)` 顶层辅助函数，用一组权重和输入向量组合出新向量。空输入、数量不一致或向量长度不一致都会直接中止。"

#: manual/api/mutable/vector.md:53
msgid "`to_col_matrix()` / `to_row_matrix()` Convert the vector into matrix form."
msgstr "`to_col_matrix()` / `to_row_matrix()` 把向量转换成矩阵形式。"

#: manual/api/mutable/vector.md:62
msgid "Use direct indexing or `*_inplace` helpers when the workload is truly mutation-heavy."
msgstr "当工作负载确实以更新为主时，直接使用索引或 `*_inplace` 辅助函数。"

#: manual/api/mutable/vector.md:64
msgid "Use the non-`inplace` helpers when you need a fresh vector or want code that mirrors `@immut.Vector` more closely."
msgstr "当你希望保留旧值，或让代码风格更接近 `@immut.Vector` 时，优先使用那些返回新向量的辅助函数。"

#: manual/api/mutable/vector.md:66
msgid "`backends/default.DenseVector` is a wrapper around this concrete implementation. If you want the trait-oriented default backend entry point, see [the `backends/default` API](../backends/default.md)."
msgstr "`backends/default.DenseVector` 包装的就是这个 concrete 实现。如果你要从 trait 导向的默认后端入口进入，请看 [backends/default API](../backends/default.md)。"

#: manual/conventions.md:1
msgid "Repository conventions"
msgstr "仓库约定"

#: manual/conventions.md:3
msgid "These rules extend the Luna-Flow documentation standard for linear-algebra. The manual describes the current implementation on the branch; the current documentation baseline is **`0.4.7`**."
msgstr "这些规则是 Luna-Flow 文档标准在 linear-algebra 中的补充。手册描述当前分支中的真实实现；当前文档基线为 **`0.4.7`**。"

#: manual/conventions.md:5
msgid "Pages and chapters"
msgstr "页面与章节"

#: manual/conventions.md:7
msgid "The [overview](index.md) describes the current release baseline: what the release contains, where to start reading, and how the packages are positioned. `CHANGELOG.md` owns the historical release timeline and older release notes."
msgstr "[概览](index.md)说明当前的版本基线：该版本包含什么、从哪里开始阅读，以及各个包的定位。`CHANGELOG.md` 负责承载历史版本时间线和较旧的发布说明。"

#: manual/conventions.md:8
msgid "The `immut` and `mutable` packages are documented per type rather than per package: `api/immut/matrix.md` and `api/immut/vector.md`, and the same under `api/mutable/`, `design/` and `tutorial/`."
msgstr "`immut` 与 `mutable` 包按类型而不是按包编写文档：`api/immut/matrix.md` 与 `api/immut/vector.md`，`api/mutable/`、`design/` 和 `tutorial/` 下也采用相同的划分。"

#: manual/conventions.md:9
msgid "The `integration/` chapter explains how external types join the `algebra` and `container` capability layers."
msgstr "`integration/` 章节说明外部类型如何接入 `algebra` 与 `container` 能力层。"

#: manual/conventions.md:10
msgid "Keep API references specification-oriented, tutorials usage-oriented, and design docs responsibility- and tradeoff-oriented"
msgstr "API 文档偏规格说明，tutorial 偏使用路径，design 偏职责边界与取舍，不要把三类文体混写"

#: manual/conventions.md:11
msgid "Backend wrapper packages should document platform constraints, conversion boundaries, and whether behavior is implemented locally or delegated to an external library kernel"
msgstr "后端包装包需要说明平台约束、转换边界，以及相关行为是在本地实现还是委托给外部库内核"

#: manual/conventions.md:12
msgid "Prefer short, direct sentences over rhetorical or release-note-style prose"
msgstr "尽量使用短句、直述句，避免口语化、宣传式或版本说明式表达"

#: manual/conventions.md:14
msgid "Shared rules for `mutable` and `immutable`"
msgstr "`mutable` 与 `immutable` 的统一规范"

#: manual/conventions.md:16
msgid "API alignment"
msgstr "API 对齐原则"

#: manual/conventions.md:18
msgid "`mutable` and `immutable` should expose the same public API whenever practical"
msgstr "`mutable` 与 `immutable` 应尽可能提供相同的公开 API"

#: manual/conventions.md:19
msgid "When both packages support the same capability, keep function names, parameter order, return semantics, and error conventions aligned"
msgstr "当两个包都支持同一能力时，优先保持一致的函数名、参数顺序、返回语义与错误约定"

#: manual/conventions.md:20
msgid "If full alignment is not possible, the docs must state the difference, the reason, and the recommended usage"
msgstr "如果因为实现约束无法完全一致，文档必须明确说明差异、原因以及推荐使用场景"

#: manual/conventions.md:21
msgid "Every new public API should be evaluated for both packages by default"
msgstr "新增公开接口时，默认同时评估是否应在两个包中都提供"

#: manual/conventions.md:23
msgid "Design principles for `immutable`"
msgstr "`immutable` 包的设计原则"

#: manual/conventions.md:25
msgid "Prefer functional, declarative, and composable interface design"
msgstr "优先采用函数式、声明式、可组合的接口设计"

#: manual/conventions.md:26
msgid "Prefer returning new values instead of exposing in-place mutation semantics"
msgstr "优先返回新值，而不是暴露原地修改语义"

#: manual/conventions.md:27
msgid "Avoid making callers reason about hidden state, shared mutable state, or timing-sensitive behavior"
msgstr "避免让调用者感知隐藏状态、共享可变状态或时序敏感行为"

#: manual/conventions.md:28
msgid "The docs should emphasize value semantics, referential transparency, and composition patterns"
msgstr "文档应强调值语义、引用透明性与组合方式"

#: manual/conventions.md:29
msgid "Even when there is a performance tradeoff, preserve clear and stable external semantics first"
msgstr "如果存在性能上的妥协，仍应优先保持外部语义清晰、稳定、易推理"

#: manual/conventions.md:31
msgid "Design principles for `mutable`"
msgstr "`mutable` 包的设计原则"

#: manual/conventions.md:33
msgid "Prioritize performance, memory reuse, and low-level execution efficiency"
msgstr "优先关注性能、内存复用与底层执行效率"

#: manual/conventions.md:34
msgid "Internal mutable state, in-place updates, and other side effects are acceptable inside the library"
msgstr "允许在库内部使用可变状态、原地更新和其他必要副作用"

#: manual/conventions.md:35
msgid "Those side effects should remain encapsulated in the implementation rather than leaking into the caller's mental model"
msgstr "这些副作用应尽可能封装在实现内部，不应扩散到调用者的心智模型中"

#: manual/conventions.md:36
msgid "The public API should still feel pure, stable, and function-oriented instead of exposing internal mutability as a contract"
msgstr "对外 API 仍应保持纯净、稳定、函数式风格，避免把内部可变实现直接暴露为接口约束"

#: manual/conventions.md:37
msgid "Introduce package-specific deviations from `immutable` only when the performance benefit is concrete and necessary"
msgstr "只有在性能收益明确且必要时，才引入与 `immutable` 不一致的特殊接口"

#: manual/conventions.md:39
msgid "Documentation requirements"
msgstr "文档写作要求"

#: manual/conventions.md:41
msgid "Use the same section structure and terminology across `mutable` and `immutable` API docs whenever possible"
msgstr "在 `mutable` 与 `immutable` 的 API 文档中，优先使用相同的小节结构与术语"

#: manual/conventions.md:42
msgid "Cross-reference corresponding APIs so readers can compare semantics and cost models easily"
msgstr "对应接口应互相链接或交叉引用，方便读者比较两个包的语义与成本"

#: manual/conventions.md:43
msgid "Clearly separate external semantics from internal implementation strategy"
msgstr "文档需要明确区分“外部语义”与“内部实现策略”"

#: manual/conventions.md:44
msgid "Performance details such as caching, reuse, and in-place computation belong in design pages or the `performance/` chapter, not in the API semantic contract."
msgstr "缓存、复用、原地计算等性能细节应写入设计页面或 `performance/` 章节，而不是写进 API 语义契约。"

#: manual/conventions.md:45
msgid "If a `mutable` API has observable behavior due to a performance-oriented design choice, document that behavior explicitly rather than only describing the internal implementation"
msgstr "当某个 `mutable` 接口为了性能采取特殊行为时，必须明确写出其可观察影响，而不是只描述内部实现细节"

#: manual/conventions.md:47
msgid "Translations"
msgstr "翻译"

#: manual/conventions.md:49
msgid "Chinese translations should read like natural written technical Chinese, not word-for-word English translation."
msgstr "中文译文应当是自然的书面技术汉语，避免逐词硬翻和不必要的中英夹杂。"

#: manual/conventions.md:50
msgid "Japanese translations should read like natural technical Japanese, not a literal structural copy of Chinese or English phrasing."
msgstr "日文译文应当是自然的技术文体，不应照搬中文或英文句式。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:1
msgid "algebra design"
msgstr "algebra 设计"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:3
msgid "For external adoption levels, operator semantics, implementation ownership, and the relationship with container dictionaries, see the [ecosystem integration guide](../integration/algebra.md)."
msgstr "外部接入层级、运算符语义、实现归属以及与 container 字典的关系，请参阅 [生态接入指南](../integration/algebra.md)。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:7
#: manual/design/arithmetic.md:3
#: manual/design/backends/default.md:3
#: manual/design/backends/openblas.md:3
#: manual/design/error.md:3
#: manual/design/immut/matrix.md:3
#: manual/design/immut/vector.md:3
#: manual/design/mutable/matrix.md:3
#: manual/design/mutable/vector.md:3
msgid "Responsibilities"
msgstr "职责"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:9
msgid "Represent semantic mathematical structures used by linear algebra."
msgstr "表示线性代数需要的语义数学结构。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:10
msgid "Keep structure-level traits separate from operation-only arithmetic traits."
msgstr "将结构级 trait 与操作级算术 trait 分开。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:11
msgid "Avoid treating approximate floating-point behavior as exact algebraic law."
msgstr "避免把近似浮点行为写成精确代数律。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:12
msgid "Keep shape, additive operations, Hadamard multiplication, matrix multiplication, and scalar-valued mappings as separate capabilities."
msgstr "将形状、加法运算、Hadamard 乘法、矩阵乘法以及返回标量值的映射保持为彼此独立的能力。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:14
msgid "Express object-level linear algebra operations by composing existing operator traits such as `Add`, `Mul`, `Neg`, and `Sub` only when a trait actually needs those operations."
msgstr "只有当某个 trait 确实需要这些运算时，才通过组合 `Add`、`Mul`、`Neg`、`Sub` 等现有运算符 trait 来表达对象级的线性代数运算。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:17
msgid "Keep shared upstream scalar abstractions outside this package; import them directly in user code when an algorithm really needs them."
msgstr "把共享上游标量抽象留在包外，只有用户代码确实需要时再直接导入。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:20
#: manual/design/arithmetic.md:10
#: manual/design/backends/default.md:10
#: manual/design/error.md:11
msgid "Non-responsibilities"
msgstr "非职责"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:22
msgid "Do not import dense backend types."
msgstr "不导入稠密后端类型。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:23
msgid "Do not define storage, mutability, or algorithm execution traits."
msgstr "不定义存储、可变操作或算法执行 trait。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:24
msgid "Do not place inner product, norm, or other scalar-valued functors in the core structure layer."
msgstr "不把内积、范数等返回标量值的映射放入核心结构层。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:26
msgid "Do not introduce `Module` or `VectorSpace` without an explicit scalar-action model."
msgstr "不在缺少显式标量作用模型时引入 `Module` 或 `VectorSpace`。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:28
msgid "Do not introduce a package-local shape-dependent zero in place of upstream `Zero`."
msgstr "不用包内依赖形状的零元替代上游 `Zero`。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:30
msgid "Do not put partial operations such as dynamic rectangular matrix multiplication in the minimum matrix shape trait."
msgstr "不把动态矩形矩阵乘法这种部分运算塞进最小矩阵形状 trait。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:33
#: manual/design/arithmetic.md:16
#: manual/design/error.md:19
msgid "Maintenance notes"
msgstr "维护说明"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:35
msgid "If a future trait needs scalar association, design it explicitly instead of encoding a fixed scalar such as `Double` into a public trait."
msgstr "如果未来某个 trait 需要关联标量类型，应显式设计出来，而不是把 `Double` 之类的固定标量偷偷编码进公开 trait。"

#: manual/design/arithmetic.md:1
msgid "arithmetic design"
msgstr "arithmetic 设计"

#: manual/design/arithmetic.md:5
msgid "Keep low-level computable operations separate from semantic algebraic laws."
msgstr "把低层可计算操作和语义代数律分开。"

#: manual/design/arithmetic.md:6
msgid "Reuse existing ecosystem scalar traits instead of redefining them locally."
msgstr "复用生态已有标量 traits，而不是在本仓库重复定义。"

#: manual/design/arithmetic.md:7
msgid "Add only small operation traits when linear-algebra-facing code needs a stable name."
msgstr "只在缺少线性代数集成名称时添加小的操作级 trait。"

#: manual/design/arithmetic.md:12
msgid "Do not define vector-space, module, matrix, or backend capabilities here."
msgstr "不定义向量空间、模、矩阵或后端能力。"

#: manual/design/arithmetic.md:13
msgid "Do not make floating-point types claim exact algebraic laws."
msgstr "不让浮点类型声称精确代数律。"

#: manual/design/arithmetic.md:14
msgid "Do not import `immut`, `mutable`, or `backends/default`."
msgstr "不导入 `immut`、`mutable` 或 `backends/default`。"

#: manual/design/arithmetic.md:18
msgid "When adding a new trait, name the operation directly and document that it represents availability of an operation, not a mathematical structure."
msgstr "新增 trait 时，名字应直接对应具体操作，并明确写出：它表示“这个操作可用”，而不是“这里成立一个数学结构”。"

#: manual/design/backends/default.md:1
msgid "backends/default design"
msgstr "backends/default 设计"

#: manual/design/backends/default.md:5
msgid "Present `immut` and `mutable` as default dense backends through owned wrapper types."
msgstr "将 `immut` 和 `mutable` 呈现为默认稠密后端。"

#: manual/design/backends/default.md:7
msgid "Implement capability traits for the default dense matrix and vector types."
msgstr "为默认稠密矩阵/向量类型实现能力 trait。"

#: manual/design/backends/default.md:8
msgid "Provide small generic helpers that exercise trait-based dispatch."
msgstr "提供小型泛型辅助函数来验证基于 trait 的分发。"

#: manual/design/backends/default.md:12
msgid "Do not redefine scalar algebra or arithmetic laws."
msgstr "不重新定义标量代数或算术律。"

#: manual/design/backends/default.md:13
msgid "Do not require all future backends to become dense or contiguous."
msgstr "不要求未来后端必须是稠密后端或连续存储。"

#: manual/design/backends/default.md:14
msgid "Do not make scalar-valued maps part of the core linear algebra trait surface."
msgstr "不把返回标量值的映射放入核心线性代数 trait 层。"

#: manual/design/backends/default.md:16
msgid "Extension model"
msgstr "扩展模型"

#: manual/design/backends/default.md:18
msgid "Future sparse, lazy, static-size, GPU, or external-library backends should implement the same structural traits directly. They should not need to convert into `DenseMatrix` or `DenseVector` before generic algorithms can use them."
msgstr "未来的稀疏、惰性、静态尺寸、GPU 或外部库后端应直接实现相同的结构 trait，不需要先转换成 `DenseMatrix` 或 `DenseVector`。"

#: manual/design/backends/openblas.md:1
msgid "backends/openblas design"
msgstr "backends/openblas 设计"

#: manual/design/backends/openblas.md:5
msgid "Provide a concrete native-only matrix backend that can participate in the public `@algebra` trait ecosystem."
msgstr "提供一个能够接入公开 `@algebra` trait 生态的、仅支持 `native` 的具体矩阵后端。"

#: manual/design/backends/openblas.md:7
msgid "Keep the backend's owned public type local to this repository as `BlasMatrix[T]`."
msgstr "把后端自有的公开类型固定为 `BlasMatrix[T]`。"

#: manual/design/backends/openblas.md:9
msgid "Use OpenBLAS GEMM for matrix multiplication while keeping the rest of the first-pass matrix surface implemented locally in MoonBit."
msgstr "对矩阵乘法使用 OpenBLAS GEMM，同时把首版其余矩阵表面留在 MoonBit 本地实现。"

#: manual/design/backends/openblas.md:11
msgid "Hide OpenBLAS layout and binding details behind a repository-owned API."
msgstr "把 OpenBLAS 的布局与绑定细节藏在仓库自有 API 后面。"

#: manual/design/backends/openblas.md:13
msgid "Why this is a wrapper backend"
msgstr "为什么它是包装后端"

#: manual/design/backends/openblas.md:15
msgid "This package is a trait-compatible backend wrapper."
msgstr "这个包是一个“兼容 trait 的后端包装层”。"

#: manual/design/backends/openblas.md:17
msgid "It is not:"
msgstr "它不是："

#: manual/design/backends/openblas.md:19
msgid "a runtime backend selector"
msgstr "runtime backend selector"

#: manual/design/backends/openblas.md:20
msgid "a global backend enum"
msgstr "全局 backend enum"

#: manual/design/backends/openblas.md:21
msgid "a direct trait implementation on the foreign OpenBLAS binding types"
msgstr "直接在外部 OpenBLAS 绑定类型上实现 trait 的做法"

#: manual/design/backends/openblas.md:23
msgid "The wrapper exists so the package owns the concrete matrix type and can attach `@algebra` trait implementations without running into MoonBit's foreign trait / foreign type restriction."
msgstr "之所以需要包装层，是因为包必须拥有具体矩阵类型，才能在不触发 MoonBit foreign trait / foreign type 限制的前提下，为它挂上 `@algebra` traits。"

#: manual/design/backends/openblas.md:27
msgid "Type and target decide behavior"
msgstr "类型与目标共同决定行为"

#: manual/design/backends/openblas.md:29
msgid "Backend choice is now determined by two things:"
msgstr "现在的后端选择由两件事决定："

#: manual/design/backends/openblas.md:31
msgid "type choice `@immut.Matrix[T]` and `@default.ImmutableDenseMatrix[T]` use the repository's existing dense implementations, while `@openblas.BlasMatrix[T]` uses the OpenBLAS-backed multiplication path"
msgstr "类型选择 `@immut.Matrix[T]` 与 `@default.ImmutableDenseMatrix[T]` 继续使用仓库现有的稠密实现；`@openblas.BlasMatrix[T]` 则使用 OpenBLAS 支持的矩阵乘法路径"

#: manual/design/backends/openblas.md:35
msgid "target choice `backends/openblas` only participates in `native` builds"
msgstr "目标选择 `backends/openblas` 只参与 `native` 构建"

#: manual/design/backends/openblas.md:38
msgid "There is no runtime API for asking `@immut.Matrix` to switch to a different backend."
msgstr "`@immut.Matrix` 不再提供运行时切换后端的 API。"

#: manual/design/backends/openblas.md:41
msgid "Scalar strategy"
msgstr "标量策略"

#: manual/design/backends/openblas.md:43
msgid "`BLASInnerType` is intentionally backend-local. It captures the scalar-specific pieces this wrapper needs:"
msgstr "`BLASInnerType` 是有意保持在后端内部的局部抽象。它封装这个包装层真正需要的标量差异："

#: manual/design/backends/openblas.md:46
msgid "dispatch to the correct GEMM kernel"
msgstr "分发到正确的 GEMM 内核"

#: manual/design/backends/openblas.md:47
msgid "provide a tolerance value for backend validation"
msgstr "提供后端校验所用的容差值"

#: manual/design/backends/openblas.md:49
msgid "The repository currently implements this trait only for `Float` and `Double`. That matches the current OpenBLAS-backed matrix surface and avoids exposing a misleading generic type story."
msgstr "当前仓库只为 `Float` 与 `Double` 实现该 trait。这与现有 OpenBLAS 后端矩阵表面一致，也避免对外讲出一个误导性的“泛型无上限”故事。"

#: manual/design/backends/openblas.md:53
msgid "Operation split"
msgstr "操作分工"

#: manual/design/backends/openblas.md:55
msgid "`Mul` delegates to OpenBLAS GEMM"
msgstr "`Mul` 委托给 OpenBLAS GEMM"

#: manual/design/backends/openblas.md:57
msgid "`shape`, `transpose`, `+`, `-`, `neg` stay as local MoonBit implementations for the first version"
msgstr "`shape`、`transpose`、`+`、`-`、`neg` 保持为本地 MoonBit 实现"

#: manual/design/backends/openblas.md:60
msgid "This split keeps the API complete enough for trait-oriented generic code without pretending that every matrix operation must already be backed by a BLAS routine."
msgstr "这种分工保证了 trait 导向泛型代码已经可以使用完整的矩阵外形，同时不假装所有操作都必须在首版就接入 BLAS 例程。"

#: manual/design/container.md:1
msgid "Container capability design"
msgstr "容器能力设计"

#: manual/design/container.md:3
msgid "Mathematical and structural capabilities"
msgstr "数学能力与结构能力"

#: manual/design/container.md:5
msgid "The `algebra` package describes mathematical behavior such as addition, transpose, and multiplication. The `container` package describes structural behavior: shape observation, checked element access, construction, and the two distinct editing models. A type may implement either layer without claiming the other."
msgstr "`algebra` 描述加法、转置和乘法等数学行为；`container` 描述形状、受检访问、构造和两种编辑模型。类型可以只实现其中一层。"

#: manual/design/container.md:11
msgid "Explicit operation dictionaries represent the relationship between container type, element type, and operation. This is clearer than forcing the multi-parameter relationship into a global trait and lets one external type publish several scalar-specific or policy-specific dictionaries."
msgstr "容器类型、元素类型和操作之间的关系通过小型显式字典表达，避免把多参数关系勉强塞入全局 trait，也允许外部类型按不同标量或策略提供多个字典。"

#: manual/design/container.md:16
msgid "The [ecosystem integration guide](../integration/container.md) defines the supported adoption levels and adapter ownership rules for external libraries."
msgstr "[生态接入指南](../integration/container.md)规定了外部库可采用的接入级别以及适配器的归属规则。"

#: manual/design/container.md:19
msgid "Ownership and editing"
msgstr "所有权与编辑"

#: manual/design/container.md:21
msgid "Persistent editing returns a new value and must preserve the source even when the implementation uses shared backing storage. Mutable editing changes the supplied container and returns `Unit` inside the checked result. Keeping these records separate prevents generic code from confusing copying with mutation."
msgstr "持久编辑返回新值，即使实现共享底层存储也必须保持源值不变。可变编辑修改传入的容器，并在受检结果中返回 `Unit`。两类记录分开后，泛型代码不会混淆复制与原地修改。"

#: manual/design/container.md:26
msgid "Generic `insert`, `delete`, `create`, and `remove` are absent. Removing a sparse entry, setting a value to zero, deleting a row, and resizing a matrix are different operations and must remain separate optional capabilities."
msgstr "基础协议不定义通用 `insert`、`delete`、`create` 或 `remove`。删除稀疏存储项、写入零、删除行和调整尺寸是不同操作。"

#: manual/design/container.md:30
msgid "Dependency direction"
msgstr "依赖方向与未来扩展"

#: manual/design/container.md:32
msgid "`container` depends only on `error`. `container/adapters` depends on the core capability package and the dense implementations. OpenBLAS depends on the core package directly and remains native-only. Neither `algebra` nor the concrete dense implementations depend on the adapter package."
msgstr "`container` 仅依赖 `error`；`container/adapters` 依赖具体稠密实现；OpenBLAS 直接依赖核心 `container` 并保持 native 限定。未来可以增加可选的 `MatrixKernelOps[M, T]`，包含受检写入、换行和行基本变换，而不破坏 read/build。"

#: manual/design/container.md:37
msgid "Future kernels"
msgstr "未来的 kernel"

#: manual/design/container.md:39
msgid "A future `MatrixKernelOps[M, T]` may group checked read/write, row swap, row scale, and scaled-row addition for elimination algorithms. It should be an optional dictionary layered beside read/build, not a requirement added to them."
msgstr "未来的 `MatrixKernelOps[M, T]` 可以为消元算法汇集受检读写、行交换、行缩放和倍加行等操作。它应当是与 read/build 并列的可选字典，而不是附加给它们的要求。"

#: manual/design/container.md:44
msgid "Sparse matrices can provide read/build dictionaries that interpret absent entries according to their own representation. Views can provide read/edit without construction."
msgstr "稀疏矩阵可以提供按自身表示解释缺省项的 read/build 字典。视图可以只提供 read/edit 而不提供构造。"

#: manual/design/error.md:1
msgid "error design"
msgstr "error 设计"

#: manual/design/error.md:5
msgid "Provide the shared error vocabulary for checked linear-algebra APIs."
msgstr "为带检查的线性代数 API 提供共享的错误类型。"

#: manual/design/error.md:6
msgid "Keep a stable machine-readable `kind` beside a human-readable `message`."
msgstr "同时保留适合程序判断的 `kind` 和适合人阅读的 `message`。"

#: manual/design/error.md:7
msgid "Let callers branch on common failure categories without parsing text."
msgstr "让调用者不需要解析错误文本，就能按常见失败类别分支处理。"

#: manual/design/error.md:8
msgid "Preserve arithmetic errors from lower-level scalar operations through `ArithmeticFailure`."
msgstr "通过 `ArithmeticFailure` 保留下层标量运算传播出来的算术错误。"

#: manual/design/error.md:13
msgid "Do not implement matrix, vector, or backend algorithms here."
msgstr "不在这里实现矩阵、向量或后端算法。"

#: manual/design/error.md:14
msgid "Do not define recovery policies for singular matrices, non-convergence, or arithmetic failures."
msgstr "不定义奇异矩阵、非收敛或算术错误的恢复策略。"

#: manual/design/error.md:16
msgid "Do not decide logging, localization, or presentation formatting."
msgstr "不负责日志、国际化或展示格式。"

#: manual/design/error.md:17
msgid "Do not use the text message as the semantic contract for control flow."
msgstr "不把 `message` 文本作为控制流判断的语义契约。"

#: manual/design/error.md:21
msgid "Add a new error kind only when checked public APIs need to expose a distinct class of failure. Keep constructors and predicate methods aligned with the enum so callers can create and inspect errors without destructuring values directly."
msgstr "只有当带检查的公开 API 需要暴露一类新的失败时，才新增错误种类。新增时应同步维护枚举项、构造函数和判断方法，让调用者无需直接拆解错误值也能创建和识别错误。"

#: manual/design/immut/matrix.md:1
msgid "immut/matrix design"
msgstr "immut/matrix 设计"

#: manual/design/immut/matrix.md:5
msgid "Provide a value-oriented `Matrix[T]` whose transformation methods return new matrices."
msgstr "提供值语义导向的 `Matrix[T]`，转换操作返回新矩阵。"

#: manual/design/immut/matrix.md:6
msgid "Keep matrix storage row-major through the immutable vector-backed representation."
msgstr "通过不可变向量支撑的表示保持按行优先存储。"

#: manual/design/immut/matrix.md:7
msgid "Keep checked matrix operations explicit: shape, exponent, and domain failures belong in `Result[..., LinearAlgebraError]`."
msgstr "对可能失败的矩阵操作使用带检查 API，让形状、指数和输入域错误通过 `Result[..., LinearAlgebraError]` 表达。"

#: manual/design/immut/matrix.md:9
#: manual/design/immut/vector.md:10
#: manual/design/mutable/matrix.md:9
#: manual/design/mutable/vector.md:10
msgid "Invariants"
msgstr "不变量"

#: manual/design/immut/matrix.md:11
msgid "Constructors reject negative dimensions and non-rectangular input."
msgstr "构造器会拒绝负维度和行长不一致的输入。"

#: manual/design/immut/matrix.md:12
msgid "Indexed access and row/column iterators enforce the same bounds rules as the mutable matrix API."
msgstr "索引访问、行迭代器和列迭代器与可变矩阵 API 保持一致的边界语义。"

#: manual/design/immut/matrix.md:13
msgid "Matrix algebra should stay aligned with `mutable` where both packages expose the same operation, while preserving value semantics."
msgstr "当 `immut` 与 `mutable` 都暴露同一代数操作时，应保持语义对齐，同时保留不可变值语义。"

#: manual/design/immut/vector.md:1
msgid "immut/vector design"
msgstr "immut/vector 设计"

#: manual/design/immut/vector.md:5
msgid "Provide a value-oriented `Vector[T]` backed by the core persistent vector storage alias."
msgstr "提供值语义导向的 `Vector[T]`，底层使用核心持久向量存储别名。"

#: manual/design/immut/vector.md:6
msgid "Keep shared vector algebra aligned with `@mutable.Vector` where the observable operation is the same."
msgstr "在可观察操作相同的共享子集上，与 `@mutable.Vector` 保持代数语义对齐。"

#: manual/design/immut/vector.md:7
msgid "Exclude in-place mutation APIs from the immutable package."
msgstr "不在不可变包中暴露原地修改 API。"

#: manual/design/immut/vector.md:8
msgid "Keep scalar-reducing helpers such as `dot()` out of this package's public surface."
msgstr "不把 `dot()` 这类标量归约辅助函数放进这个公开接口里。"

#: manual/design/immut/vector.md:12
msgid "`set`, `map`, and scale operations return new vectors."
msgstr "`set`、`map` 和缩放操作返回新向量。"

#: manual/design/immut/vector.md:13
msgid "Indexing follows the underlying immutable vector bounds behavior."
msgstr "索引访问遵循底层不可变向量的边界行为。"

#: manual/design/immut/vector.md:14
msgid "Matrix conversion helpers produce row or column matrices without exposing mutable storage."
msgstr "矩阵转换辅助函数生成行矩阵或列矩阵，不暴露可变存储。"

#: manual/design/immut/vector.md:15
msgid "Shared element-wise operations stay aligned with `@mutable.Vector`, but the immutable package remains focused on value-producing transforms."
msgstr "共享的按元素操作会尽量与 `@mutable.Vector` 对齐，但这个包仍然只关注返回新值的变换。"

#: manual/design/mutable/matrix.md:1
msgid "mutable/matrix design"
msgstr "mutable/matrix 设计"

#: manual/design/mutable/matrix.md:5
msgid "Provide an execution-oriented `Matrix[T]` with row-major `Array[T]` storage across supported backends."
msgstr "提供执行导向的 `Matrix[T]`，在支持的后端上保持按行优先的 `Array[T]` 存储模型。"

#: manual/design/mutable/matrix.md:6
msgid "Keep live row, column, and transpose views connected to the underlying matrix."
msgstr "让行视图、列视图和转置视图始终连接到底层矩阵。"

#: manual/design/mutable/matrix.md:7
msgid "Keep checked APIs for runtime failures while preserving explicit `unchecked_*` methods for legacy contracts."
msgstr "为运行时失败保留带检查 API，同时用显式 `unchecked_*` 方法承载旧契约。"

#: manual/design/mutable/matrix.md:11
msgid "Backend-specific files may tune kernels, but they must expose the same public semantics."
msgstr "后端专用文件可以优化内核，但必须暴露相同的公开语义。"

#: manual/design/mutable/matrix.md:12
msgid "Bounds checks are explicit for matrix, view, iterator, and transpose access."
msgstr "矩阵、视图、迭代器和转置访问都执行显式边界检查。"

#: manual/design/mutable/matrix.md:13
msgid "Shared algebraic operations should stay semantically aligned with `immut` where both packages expose them."
msgstr "当 `mutable` 与 `immut` 都暴露同一代数操作时，应保持语义对齐。"

#: manual/design/mutable/vector.md:1
msgid "mutable/vector design"
msgstr "mutable/vector 设计"

#: manual/design/mutable/vector.md:5
msgid "Provide an execution-oriented `Vector[T]` backed by `Array[T]`."
msgstr "提供执行导向的 `Vector[T]`，底层包装 `Array[T]`。"

#: manual/design/mutable/vector.md:6
msgid "Support direct indexed reads and writes for workloads that need in-place updates."
msgstr "支持直接索引读写，服务需要原地更新的工作负载。"

#: manual/design/mutable/vector.md:7
msgid "Keep non-`inplace` algebraic helpers available for value-producing transforms."
msgstr "保留不带 `inplace` 后缀的代数辅助函数，让调用方也能选择返回新值的变换。"

#: manual/design/mutable/vector.md:8
msgid "Keep scalar-reducing and aggregate helpers such as `dot()` in the mutable package."
msgstr "把 `dot()` 这类标量归约和 `lin_comb(...)` 这类组合辅助函数留在可变包中。"

#: manual/design/mutable/vector.md:12
msgid "`*_inplace` methods mutate the existing vector and return `Unit`."
msgstr "`*_inplace` 方法修改现有向量并返回 `Unit`。"

#: manual/design/mutable/vector.md:13
msgid "`map`, scale helpers, `zip_with`, and matrix conversion helpers return new values."
msgstr "`map`、缩放辅助函数、`zip_with` 和矩阵转换辅助函数返回新值。"

#: manual/design/mutable/vector.md:14
msgid "Vector algebra should stay aligned with `@immut.Vector` for the shared operation subset."
msgstr "在共享操作子集上，向量代数语义应与 `@immut.Vector` 保持对齐。"

#: manual/design/mutable/vector.md:15
msgid "Length-sensitive helpers such as `dot()` and `lin_comb(...)` reject inconsistent inputs explicitly."
msgstr "`dot()` 和 `lin_comb(...)` 这类对长度敏感的辅助函数会显式拒绝不一致的输入。"

#: manual/index.md:1
msgid "Luna-Flow/linear-algebra"
msgstr "Luna-Flow/linear-algebra"

#: manual/index.md:3
msgid "This overview matches the current repository baseline for **v0.4.7**."
msgstr "这份概览对应当前仓库的 **v0.4.7** 基线。"

#: manual/index.md:5
msgid "The `mutable` numerical APIs use the shared `Luna-Flow/arithmetic.Sqrt` capability, while integral embeddings follow `Luna-Flow/luna-generic.IntegralHomomorphism`. `Tolerance` remains local to the `mutable` package in this release. Matrix operations with runtime failure modes now use checked `Result[..., LinearAlgebraError]` APIs; the old aborting or `Option`-returning behavior is exposed through explicit `unchecked_*` methods."
msgstr "`mutable` 数值 API 现在使用共享的 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic.Sqrt` 能力；整数嵌入遵循 `Luna-Flow/luna-generic.IntegralHomomorphism`。在当前版本中， `Tolerance` 仍保留在 `mutable` 包内。凡是可能在运行时失败的矩阵操作，现在都使用带检查的 `Result[..., LinearAlgebraError]` API；旧的 abort 行为和 `Option` 返回语义则通过显式的 `unchecked_*` 方法保留。"

#: manual/index.md:12
msgid "The `0.4.7` baseline adds the storage-independent `container` capability layer, generic vector and matrix algorithms, adapters for the concrete storage representations, and documented algebra integration levels for external types."
msgstr "`0.4.7` 这一基线新增了与存储无关的 `container` 能力层、通用向量与矩阵算法、面向具体存储表示的适配器，以及供外部类型采用的 algebra 集成层级。"

#: manual/index.md:16
msgid "For earlier release notes and repository history, see [CHANGELOG.md](../../CHANGELOG.md)."
msgstr "更早的版本说明和仓库历史请参见 [CHANGELOG.md](../../CHANGELOG.md)。"

#: manual/index.md:19
msgid "Layered architecture"
msgstr "分层架构"

#: manual/index.md:21
msgid "**Experimental features:** The `algebra` and `container` capability layers are available for integration experiments and ecosystem feedback, but their trait hierarchy, operation dictionaries, error contracts, and function signatures are not yet compatibility-stable. Downstream libraries should not use these packages as stable public boundaries yet. This status does not make the concrete `immut`, `mutable`, or backend APIs experimental merely because they implement or adapt these capabilities."
msgstr "**实验性功能：** `algebra` 与 `container` 能力层目前用于接入试验和收集生态反馈；它们的 trait 层级、操作字典、错误契约和函数签名尚未承诺兼容性稳定。下游库暂时不应把这两个包作为稳定的公开兼容边界。`immut`、`mutable` 和各后端仅仅因为实现或适配这些能力，并不会因此整体变成实验性 API。"

#: manual/index.md:29
msgid "**`arithmetic`**: Linear-algebra-facing operation capabilities. It reuses scalar operation traits from `Luna-Flow/luna-generic` and `Luna-Flow/arithmetic`, and adds operation-only traits where needed."
msgstr "**`arithmetic`**：面向线性代数的操作能力层。它复用 `Luna-Flow/luna-generic` 和 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` 中的标量操作 trait，并在需要时补充只表达“可进行某类操作”的 trait。"

#: manual/index.md:32
msgid "**`algebra`**: Semantic mathematical structure capabilities. It defines only the linear-algebra-owned structure traits."
msgstr "**`algebra`**：数学结构能力层。它只定义线性代数自己拥有的结构 trait。"

#: manual/index.md:34
msgid "**`backends/default`**: The reference dense backend layer. It exposes mutable dense wrappers `DenseVector` / `DenseMatrix` and immutable dense wrappers `ImmutableDenseVector` / `ImmutableDenseMatrix`."
msgstr "**`backends/default`**：参考稠密后端层。它公开可变稠密包装类型 `DenseVector` / `DenseMatrix`，以及不可变稠密包装类型 `ImmutableDenseVector` / `ImmutableDenseMatrix`。"

#: manual/index.md:37
msgid "**`backends/openblas`**: A native-only OpenBLAS backend. It exposes the owned `BlasMatrix[T]` and `BlasVector[T]` wrappers for `Float` and `Double`, uses OpenBLAS GEMM for matrix multiplication, and provides backend methods backed by BLAS vector and matrix-vector kernels."
msgstr "**`backends/openblas`**：仅支持 `native` 的 OpenBLAS 后端。它公开仓库自有的 `BlasMatrix[T]` 与 `BlasVector[T]` 包装类型，支持 `Float` 与 `Double`，矩阵乘法使用 OpenBLAS GEMM，向量与矩阵-向量交互则使用对应的 BLAS 核心，后端选择通过具体类型表达，而不是通过运行时 selector 表达。"

#: manual/index.md:41
msgid "**`error`**: Shared error vocabulary for checked linear-algebra APIs, including shape, exponent, empty-matrix, singular-matrix, non-convergence, and arithmetic failures."
msgstr "**`error`**：带检查线性代数 API 共用的错误词汇层，覆盖形状、指数、空矩阵、奇异矩阵、非收敛以及底层算术错误。"

#: manual/index.md:44
msgid "**Trait-driven algorithms**: Backend-independent code should depend on the smallest capability it needs, such as `MatrixShape`, `AdditiveVector`, `VecMulVector`, `TransposeMatrix`, or `MatMulMatrix`."
msgstr "**trait 驱动算法**：后端无关代码应依赖最小必要能力，例如 `MatrixShape`、`AdditiveVector`、`VecMulVector`、`TransposeMatrix` 或 `MatMulMatrix`。"

#: manual/index.md:48
msgid "Mappings from vector or matrix objects into scalar-like categories, such as inner products or norms, are backend or algorithm details. They are not part of the core structure trait layer."
msgstr "把向量或矩阵映射为标量范畴的能力，例如内积或范数，属于具体后端或算法细节；它们不属于核心结构 trait 层。"

#: manual/index.md:52
msgid "The default dense implementation is a backend, not the center of the ecosystem. Algorithms should depend on minimal linear algebra traits, not concrete dense matrix/vector types."
msgstr "默认稠密实现只是一个后端，不是整个生态的中心。算法应依赖最小的线性代数 trait，而不是依赖具体的稠密矩阵或向量类型。"

#: manual/index.md:56
msgid "This repository is intended to be the linear-algebra substrate for higher-level math, geometry, and solver-style libraries. Domain-specific solve, regression, or optimization workflows should live in downstream packages built on these traits, backend wrappers, and concrete matrix/vector types."
msgstr "这个仓库的定位，是给更上层的数学库、几何库和 solver 风格库提供线性代数基础层。领域特定的求解、回归或优化工作流，应放在基于这些 trait、后端包装类型和具体矩阵/向量类型构建的下游包中。"

#: manual/index.md:61
msgid "The concrete `immut` / `mutable` matrix and vector types are the implementations wrapped by `backends/default`. `DenseVector` and `DenseMatrix` wrap `@mutable.Vector` and `@mutable.Matrix`, while `ImmutableDenseVector` and `ImmutableDenseMatrix` wrap `@immut.Vector` and `@immut.Matrix`. For OpenBLAS-backed native matrix multiplication and vector kernels, choose [`backends/openblas`](./api/backends/openblas.md) explicitly. It is a separate concrete backend, not a runtime backend option inside `@immut.Matrix`."
msgstr "具体的 `immut` / `mutable` 矩阵与向量类型，就是 `backends/default` 包装层所使用的底层实现。`DenseVector` 和 `DenseMatrix` 包装 `@mutable.Vector` 与 `@mutable.Matrix`；`ImmutableDenseVector` 和 `ImmutableDenseMatrix` 包装 `@immut.Vector` 与 `@immut.Matrix`。如果需要 OpenBLAS 支持的 native 矩阵乘法与向量 BLAS 核心，请显式选择 [`backends/openblas`](./api/backends/openblas.md)。它是独立的具体后端，不是 `@immut.Matrix` 内部的运行时后端选项。"

#: manual/index.md:70
msgid "Reader guide"
msgstr "导览指南"

#: manual/index.md:72
msgid "**General application developers**: start with [mutable](./api/mutable/matrix.md) and [immut](./api/immut/matrix.md). These are the concrete APIs for application code such as business tools, utilities, numeric processing, small games, and visualization logic."
msgstr "**一般应用开发者**：从 [mutable](./api/mutable/matrix.md) 和 [immut](./api/immut/matrix.md) 开始。它们是面向应用代码的具体 API，适合业务工具、实用程序、数值处理、小型游戏和可视化逻辑等场景。"

#: manual/index.md:77
msgid "**Math library / general algorithm developers**: read in this order: [arithmetic](./api/arithmetic.md) -> [algebra](./integration/algebra.md) -> [container](./integration/container.md) -> [backends/default](./api/backends/default.md) -> [backends/openblas](./api/backends/openblas.md) -> [immut / mutable](./api/immut/matrix.md). Start from operation capabilities, then structure capabilities, then the default backend wrappers, then the optional OpenBLAS native wrapper, and finally the concrete implementations. This is the intended entry path if you are building a higher-level application library or solver-oriented package on top of this repository."
msgstr "**数学库 / 通用算法开发者**：建议按这个顺序阅读： [arithmetic](./api/arithmetic.md) -> [algebra](./integration/algebra.md) -> [container](./integration/container.md) -> [backends/default](./api/backends/default.md) -> [backends/openblas](./api/backends/openblas.md) -> [immut / mutable](./api/immut/matrix.md)。先看操作能力，再看结构能力，再看默认后端包装层，再看可选的 OpenBLAS native 包装层，最后落到具体实现。如果你准备在这个仓库之上构建更高层的应用库、几何包或 solver 风格包，这就是推荐的入口路径。"

#: manual/index.md:91
msgid "Used in"
msgstr "下游使用示例"

#: manual/index.md:93
msgid "**[`Luna-Flow/geometry3d`](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/geometry3d)**: a compact MoonBit 3D geometry foundation built on `Luna-Flow/linear-algebra`. It adds core geometry, camera/view math, backend-neutral rendering, and TUI / Canvas / GSAP backends on top. Its [documentation](https://luna-flow.github.io/en/geometry3d/) is a good concrete downstream entry point."
msgstr "**[`Luna-Flow/geometry3d`](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/geometry3d)**：一个建立在 `Luna-Flow/linear-algebra` 之上的 MoonBit 3D 几何基础库。它在此基础上继续提供核心几何、camera/view 数学、后端无关渲染，以及 TUI / Canvas / GSAP 后端。它的[文档](https://luna-flow.github.io/en/geometry3d/)可以作为一个具体的下游示例入口。"

#: manual/index.md:100
msgid "Trait-oriented project setup"
msgstr "抽象层项目配置"

#: manual/index.md:102
msgid "If you want to write backend-independent code with the abstract capability layers, add the shared upstream abstraction packages explicitly:"
msgstr "如果你想使用抽象能力层来编写后端无关代码，请显式安装它所依赖的上游抽象包："

#: manual/index.md:122
msgid "Use `@algebra` for linear-algebra structure traits, `@la_arithmetic` for linear-algebra-facing operation traits, `@lf_alg` for shared upstream algebraic abstractions, and `@lf_arith` for shared upstream arithmetic types."
msgstr "使用 `@algebra` 表示线性代数结构 trait，`@la_arithmetic` 表示面向线性代数的操作 trait，`@lf_alg` 表示共享的上游代数抽象，`@lf_arith` 表示共享的上游算术类型。"

#: manual/index.md:126
msgid "Repository positioning"
msgstr "仓库定位"

#: manual/index.md:128
msgid "Matrix and vector infrastructure with both mutable and immutable execution models."
msgstr "同时提供可变与不可变执行模型的矩阵/向量基础设施。"

#: manual/index.md:131
msgid "Module overview"
msgstr "模块概览"

