msgstr "优先选择能准确表达算法意义的最小结构约束。"

#: manual/tutorial/algebra.md:74
msgid "Keep backend-specific products, norms, or solve routines out of the core structure layer unless they can be expressed generically."
msgstr "内积、范数、求解等后端或算法特化行为，不要随便塞进核心结构层。"

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:1
msgid "arithmetic tutorial"
msgstr "arithmetic 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:5
msgid "Install the shared abstraction packages first:"
msgstr "先把共享抽象层依赖装好："

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:23
msgid "Small case: turn a signed residual into a penalty signal"
msgstr "小案例：把带符号残差转成惩罚值"

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:37
msgid "This case is small, but it captures the role of the `arithmetic` layer:"
msgstr "这个例子很小，但正好体现了 `arithmetic` 层的职责："

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:39
msgid "Start from a raw scalar value produced by a linear-algebra routine."
msgstr "从线性代数流程里拿到一个原始标量值。"

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:40
msgid "Ask only for the concrete operation you need, here `Abs`."
msgstr "只声明当前真正需要的操作，这里是 `Abs`。"

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:41
msgid "Convert the signed residual into a penalty value without claiming a richer algebraic structure."
msgstr "把带符号残差转成惩罚值，而不额外声称它满足更强的代数结构。"

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:43
msgid "That is the right fit when the algorithm needs a computable helper, not a full mathematical contract."
msgstr "当算法需要的是“一个能算的操作”，而不是“完整数学结构”时，这就是最合适的分层。"

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:48
msgid "Use `arithmetic` when the algorithm needs an operation such as `abs`, checked division, checked square root, or approximate comparison."
msgstr "当算法需要 `abs`、带检查除法、带检查平方根、近似比较这类具体操作时，优先看 `arithmetic`。"

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:49
msgid "Keep the requirement as narrow as possible so more scalar types can satisfy it."
msgstr "约束尽量收窄，这样更多标量类型都能复用你的算法。"

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:50
msgid "Move up to `algebra` only when the algorithm depends on a stronger structural meaning."
msgstr "只有当算法依赖更强的结构语义时，再升级到 `algebra`。"

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:54
msgid "Prefer existing `Luna-Flow/luna-generic` or `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` traits when they already express the operation."
msgstr "如果 `Luna-Flow/luna-generic` 或 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` 已经表达了该能力，优先复用上游 trait。"

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:55
msgid "Add local linear-algebra-facing traits only when an upstream capability name is missing."
msgstr "只有当上游缺少合适名称时，才补本地的线性代数能力 trait。"

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:56
msgid "Do not use an arithmetic-only trait as a substitute for a stronger algebraic guarantee."
msgstr "不要拿 arithmetic-only trait 去替代更强的代数保证。"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:1
msgid "backends/default tutorial"
msgstr "backends/default 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:3
msgid "Small case: accept the default dense backend without hard-wiring the algorithm"
msgstr "小案例：使用默认稠密后端，但不把算法写死在具体实现上"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:23
msgid "This case demonstrates the intended role of the default backend layer:"
msgstr "这个例子体现了默认后端层的正确用法："

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:25
msgid "Construct a concrete dense matrix with `DenseMatrix`."
msgstr "用 `DenseMatrix` 构造一个可直接上手的具体稠密矩阵。"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:26
msgid "Pass it into a helper that asks only for `MatrixShape`."
msgstr "把它传给一个只要求 `MatrixShape` 能力的辅助函数。"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:27
msgid "Let `@default.shape_of` bridge the concrete wrapper and the public trait-oriented view."
msgstr "通过 `@default.shape_of` 把具体包装类型和公开 trait 视图连起来。"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:29
msgid "That gives users a ready-to-use dense backend while still keeping new algorithms portable."
msgstr "这样既给用户提供了开箱即用的默认后端，也保留了后续把算法迁移到其他后端的空间。"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:34
msgid "Start with `DenseMatrix`, `DenseVector`, `ImmutableDenseMatrix`, or `ImmutableDenseVector` when you want the repository's reference backend immediately."
msgstr "当你想马上用仓库自带的参考实现时，从 `DenseMatrix`、`DenseVector`、`ImmutableDenseMatrix`、`ImmutableDenseVector` 开始。"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:35
msgid "Write new reusable helpers against `algebra` traits such as `MatrixShape`."
msgstr "当你在写可复用算法时，优先让函数依赖 `MatrixShape` 这类 `algebra` trait。"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:36
msgid "Keep the backend wrapper at the boundary where concrete storage is actually chosen."
msgstr "把具体存储和具体后端的选择，尽量留在最外层边界。"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:40
msgid "Use the default backend wrappers when you want a public dense implementation with straightforward constructors."
msgstr "当你需要一个公开、直接、稠密的默认实现时，使用这些 default backend 包装类型。"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:41
msgid "Keep backend-specific products, norms, solve strategies, or decompositions in the backend or a dedicated algorithm layer unless they can be expressed as same-category structural operations."
msgstr "标量值乘积、范数、求解策略、分解策略这类后端特化行为，除非能表达成同类结构操作，否则应留在后端层或专门算法层。"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:42
msgid "Treat `backends/default` as a bridge layer, not as the only place where generic linear algebra code should live."
msgstr "把 `backends/default` 视作桥接层，而不是所有泛型线性代数代码的归宿。"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/openblas.md:1
msgid "backends/openblas tutorial"
msgstr "backends/openblas 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/openblas.md:3
msgid "Before you start"
msgstr "开始前"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/openblas.md:5
msgid "`backends/openblas` is `native` only. The current repository configuration searches OpenBLAS from:"
msgstr "`backends/openblas` 只支持 `native`。当前仓库配置会搜索以下 OpenBLAS 路径："

#: manual/tutorial/backends/openblas.md:15
msgid "This covers the default Homebrew layout on macOS and the default Ubuntu OpenBLAS package layout. If OpenBLAS is not installed in one of those places, native build and test commands for this package will fail at compile or link time."
msgstr "这同时覆盖 macOS 的 Homebrew 安装布局，以及 Ubuntu 默认的 OpenBLAS 包布局。如果系统里没有这些路径，这个包的 `native` 构建或测试会在编译或链接阶段失败。"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/openblas.md:20
msgid "Construct a `BlasMatrix`"
msgstr "构造 `BlasMatrix`"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/openblas.md:34
msgid "Use `Float` or `Double`. Those are the only scalar types that currently implement `BLASInnerType`."
msgstr "当前只支持 `Float` 与 `Double`，因为只有这两种标量实现了 `BLASInnerType`。"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/openblas.md:37
msgid "Multiply matrices through OpenBLAS"
msgstr "通过 OpenBLAS 进行矩阵乘法"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/openblas.md:56
msgid "`Mul` is the operation that goes through OpenBLAS GEMM. Dimension mismatch keeps the same semantics as the repository's other unchecked matrix multiplication paths: it aborts."
msgstr "`Mul` 是当前真正走 OpenBLAS GEMM 的操作。维度不兼容时，语义与仓库现有其他 unchecked 矩阵乘法路径一致：直接 abort。"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/openblas.md:60
msgid "Convert between `BlasMatrix` and the default immutable dense backend"
msgstr "在 `BlasMatrix` 与默认不可变稠密后端之间互转"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/openblas.md:75
msgid "Equivalent conversion APIs also exist for the concrete immutable matrix type:"
msgstr "与具体不可变矩阵类型也提供了等价互转接口："

#: manual/tutorial/backends/openblas.md:80
msgid "Minimal native test flow"
msgstr "最小 `native` 测试流程"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/openblas.md:82
msgid "Use native commands when exercising this backend:"
msgstr "这个后端必须使用 `native` 目标来运行："

#: manual/tutorial/backends/openblas.md:89
msgid "If you want to depend on this package from another MoonBit package, keep the same rule in mind: choose `BlasMatrix` explicitly and build for `native`."
msgstr "如果你要在别的 MoonBit 包里使用它，也遵循同一条规则：显式选择 `BlasMatrix`，并以 `native` 目标编译。"

#: manual/tutorial/container.md:1
msgid "Container capability tutorial"
msgstr "容器能力教程"

#: manual/tutorial/container.md:3
msgid "Convert between existing backends"
msgstr "在现有后端之间转换"

#: manual/tutorial/container.md:5
msgid "This example copies a default mutable dense matrix into the default immutable dense representation. Later mutation of the source cannot affect the target."
msgstr "这个示例把默认的可变稠密矩阵复制为默认的不可变稠密表示。之后修改源矩阵不会影响目标。"

#: manual/tutorial/container.md:22
msgid "Use `matrix_map` instead when conversion also changes the scalar type."
msgstr "如果还需要改变标量类型，请使用 `matrix_map`。"

#: manual/tutorial/error.md:1
msgid "error tutorial"
msgstr "error 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/error.md:3
msgid "Small case: classify a failed inverse request"
msgstr "小案例：给失败的求逆请求分类"

#: manual/tutorial/error.md:28
msgid "This case models a caller that wants to recover differently from different matrix failures:"
msgstr "这个例子模拟的是：调用方希望根据不同失败原因采取不同恢复策略。"

#: manual/tutorial/error.md:31
msgid "Call a checked API that returns `Result[..., LinearAlgebraError]`."
msgstr "调用一个返回 `Result[..., LinearAlgebraError]` 的带检查 API。"

#: manual/tutorial/error.md:32
msgid "Branch on the error predicates instead of guessing from a message string."
msgstr "通过错误谓词分支，而不是去猜测错误消息字符串。"

#: manual/tutorial/error.md:33
msgid "Return a fallback diagnostic only when the failure does not match a known recovery path."
msgstr "只有在不属于已知恢复路径时，才退回到通用诊断消息。"

#: manual/tutorial/error.md:35
msgid "That keeps control flow stable even if the human-readable message changes."
msgstr "这样即使人类可读的错误文案以后调整，控制流本身仍然稳定。"

#: manual/tutorial/error.md:39
msgid "Use checked matrix APIs in user-facing or data-dependent code."
msgstr "面向用户输入或运行时数据的代码，优先使用带检查矩阵 API。"

#: manual/tutorial/error.md:40
msgid "Match on `Ok` / `Err` as close as possible to the place where recovery decisions are made."
msgstr "尽量在真正需要恢复决策的地方就地匹配 `Ok` / `Err`。"

#: manual/tutorial/error.md:41
msgid "Use `is_dimension_mismatch`, `is_negative_exponent`, `is_empty_matrix`, `is_non_square_matrix`, and related predicates to drive control flow."
msgstr "用 `is_dimension_mismatch`、`is_negative_exponent`、`is_empty_matrix`、`is_non_square_matrix` 等方法驱动控制流。"

#: manual/tutorial/error.md:45
msgid "Use `message` for diagnostics, logs, or a final fallback error, not for control-flow parsing."
msgstr "`message` 适合做诊断、日志和兜底提示，不适合做控制流解析。"

#: manual/tutorial/error.md:46
msgid "Treat `ArithmeticFailure` as a boundary for scalar arithmetic errors coming from lower-level arithmetic packages."
msgstr "把 `ArithmeticFailure` 当作下层算术包传播出来的边界错误。"

#: manual/tutorial/error.md:47
msgid "Fall back to `unchecked_*` only when surrounding code has already guaranteed the required preconditions."
msgstr "只有在外围逻辑已经保证前置条件时，才退回 `unchecked_*`。"

#: manual/tutorial/immut/matrix.md:1
msgid "immut/matrix tutorial"
msgstr "immut/matrix 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/immut/matrix.md:3
msgid "Small case: blur a tiny ASCII sprite with a 3x3 kernel"
msgstr "小案例：用 `3x3` 卷积核给微型 ASCII 字符画做模糊"

#: manual/tutorial/immut/matrix.md:79
msgid "This case shows a value-oriented matrix workflow that feels close to a real image-processing toy:"
msgstr "这个案例展示了一个更接近真实用途的值语义矩阵流程："

#: manual/tutorial/immut/matrix.md:82
msgid "Store a tiny sprite as an intensity matrix."
msgstr "先把一张很小的字符画写成亮度矩阵。"

#: manual/tutorial/immut/matrix.md:83
msgid "Rebuild a new matrix with `Matrix::make`, one blurred output cell at a time."
msgstr "用 `Matrix::make` 一格一格重建输出矩阵。"

#: manual/tutorial/immut/matrix.md:84
msgid "Sample a 3x3 neighborhood with index reads such as `source[row][col]`."
msgstr "用 `source[row][col]` 这样的索引读取 `3x3` 邻域。"

#: manual/tutorial/immut/matrix.md:85
msgid "Render the result back into visible ASCII output for a quick correctness check."
msgstr "最后再把结果渲染回字符画，直接检查模糊效果是否符合预期。"

#: manual/tutorial/immut/matrix.md:87
msgid "Because the blur returns a new matrix, the original sprite stays available for comparison. That is often the nicest property of the immutable path when you want to inspect intermediate transforms."
msgstr "因为模糊操作会返回一份新矩阵，所以原始字符画仍然保留下来，方便你对照输入和输出。这正是不可变矩阵在调试中间变换时很省心的一点。"

#: manual/tutorial/immut/matrix.md:93
#: manual/tutorial/mutable/matrix.md:38
msgid "Build matrices with `Matrix::from_2d_array`, `Matrix::make`, `Matrix::new`, or `Matrix::from_array`."
msgstr "使用 `Matrix::from_2d_array`、`Matrix::make`、`Matrix::new` 或 `Matrix::from_array` 构造矩阵。"

#: manual/tutorial/immut/matrix.md:94
msgid "Use `Matrix::make` when every output cell depends on a neighborhood or stencil from the source matrix."
msgstr "当每个输出单元都依赖源矩阵里的一个邻域或 stencil 时，优先用 `Matrix::make`。"

#: manual/tutorial/immut/matrix.md:95
msgid "Prefer checked `matmul`, `trace`, `determinant`, and `pow` when shape or domain failures can come from runtime data."
msgstr "当形状或输入域可能来自运行时数据时，优先使用带检查的 `matmul`、`trace`、`determinant` 和 `pow`。"

#: manual/tutorial/immut/matrix.md:99
msgid "Use `unchecked_*` only when surrounding code has already enforced the required preconditions."
msgstr "只有在外层逻辑已经保证前置条件时，才使用 `unchecked_*`。"

#: manual/tutorial/immut/matrix.md:100
msgid "Use `MatrixFn` when a lazy functional matrix representation is more appropriate than materialized storage."
msgstr "当惰性的函数式矩阵表示比物化存储更合适时，使用 `MatrixFn`。"

#: manual/tutorial/immut/matrix.md:101
msgid "Clamp or otherwise define your border policy explicitly when you write kernel-style transforms."
msgstr "写卷积核风格的变换时，边界处理一定要显式写清楚；这里使用的是 edge clamp。"

#: manual/tutorial/immut/matrix.md:102
msgid "Prefer the immutable path when updates should remain explicit and old matrix values still need to be preserved for later steps."
msgstr "当更新需要保持显式、而旧矩阵值还要在后续步骤中保留时，优先采用不可变矩阵路径。"

#: manual/tutorial/immut/vector.md:1
msgid "immut/vector tutorial"
msgstr "immut/vector 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/immut/vector.md:3
msgid "Small case: rebuild a published feature vector"
msgstr "小案例：重建一份已发布的特征向量"

#: manual/tutorial/immut/vector.md:31
msgid "This case reads like a tiny release-preparation pipeline:"
msgstr "这个案例可以看成一个很小的发布前处理流程："

#: manual/tutorial/immut/vector.md:33
msgid "Start from a published feature vector."
msgstr "从一份已经发布的基础向量开始。"

#: manual/tutorial/immut/vector.md:34
msgid "Apply one explicit correction with `set`."
msgstr "用 `set` 对一个位置做显式修正。"

#: manual/tutorial/immut/vector.md:35
msgid "Build a new weighted vector with `lin_comb`."
msgstr "用 `lin_comb` 组合出新的加权结果。"

#: manual/tutorial/immut/vector.md:36
msgid "Expand it into a matrix-shaped artifact with `tensor_product`."
msgstr "用 `tensor_product` 把它扩展成矩阵形态的输出。"

#: manual/tutorial/immut/vector.md:38
msgid "At no point is the original vector mutated, so earlier states remain usable."
msgstr "整个过程不会修改原始向量，所以旧值仍然可以安全复用。"

#: manual/tutorial/immut/vector.md:42
#: manual/tutorial/mutable/vector.md:38
msgid "Create vectors with `Vector::from_array`, `Vector::make`, or `Vector::makei`."
msgstr "使用 `Vector::from_array`、`Vector::make` 或 `Vector::makei` 创建向量。"

#: manual/tutorial/immut/vector.md:43
msgid "Use `set`, `map`, `left_scale`, and `right_scale` when you want a new vector."
msgstr "需要新向量时，使用 `set`、`map`、`left_scale` 和 `right_scale`。"

#: manual/tutorial/immut/vector.md:44
msgid "Use `tensor_product`, `scaled_matrix`, `to_row_matrix`, and `to_col_matrix` for matrix-facing conversions."
msgstr "需要矩阵相关转换时，使用 `tensor_product`、`scaled_matrix`、`to_row_matrix` 和 `to_col_matrix`。"

#: manual/tutorial/immut/vector.md:48
msgid "Choose `@immut.Vector` when downstream code benefits from explicit value semantics."
msgstr "当下游代码需要明确的值语义时，选择 `@immut.Vector`。"

#: manual/tutorial/immut/vector.md:49
msgid "Use `@mutable.Vector` instead when repeated in-place updates or a public `dot()` helper are part of the workload."
msgstr "当工作负载包含大量原地更新，或者需要公开的 `dot()` 辅助函数时，选择 `@mutable.Vector`。"

#: manual/tutorial/immut/vector.md:50
msgid "Use the immutable path when every structural change should produce a fresh value that can be passed onward safely."
msgstr "如果你希望每一次结构变化都返回一个新值，并把旧值安全地继续传递下去，优先选择这条不可变路径。"

#: manual/tutorial/mutable/matrix.md:1
msgid "mutable/matrix tutorial"
msgstr "mutable/matrix 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/mutable/matrix.md:3
msgid "Small case: calibrate a dense numeric matrix"
msgstr "小案例：校准一份稠密数值矩阵"

#: manual/tutorial/mutable/matrix.md:26
msgid "This pattern works well when a matrix is a live working buffer:"
msgstr "这类模式很适合把矩阵当作一个活的工作缓冲区："

#: manual/tutorial/mutable/matrix.md:28
msgid "Build the matrix once."
msgstr "先构造好具体矩阵。"

#: manual/tutorial/mutable/matrix.md:29
msgid "Use `row_view` and `col_view` to patch the hot regions directly."
msgstr "用 `row_view` 和 `col_view` 直接修改热点区域。"

#: manual/tutorial/mutable/matrix.md:30
msgid "Run checked numeric APIs like `determinant()` and `inverse()` after the edits are complete."
msgstr "编辑完成后，再调用 `determinant()`、`inverse()` 这样的带检查数值 API。"

#: manual/tutorial/mutable/matrix.md:33
msgid "That combination is the fastest path when the matrix is a concrete execution object rather than a historical value."
msgstr "当矩阵是执行对象而不是历史值时，这条路径通常最直接。"

#: manual/tutorial/mutable/matrix.md:39
msgid "Use `get` and `set` for direct element access, and `row_view` / `col_view` for repeated row or column work."
msgstr "用 `get` 和 `set` 直接访问元素；需要反复处理某行或某列时，使用 `row_view` / `col_view`。"

#: manual/tutorial/mutable/matrix.md:40
msgid "Use checked methods such as `trace`, `determinant`, `inverse`, `mul_vec`, and `pow` when inputs may fail at runtime."
msgstr "当输入可能在运行时失败时，使用带检查的 `trace`、`determinant`、`inverse`、`mul_vec` 和 `pow`。"

#: manual/tutorial/mutable/matrix.md:44
msgid "Use `to_transpose()` when you need a live transposed view; use `transpose()` when you need a materialized matrix."
msgstr "需要连接到底层矩阵的转置视图时使用 `to_transpose()`；需要物化矩阵时使用 `transpose()`。"

#: manual/tutorial/mutable/matrix.md:45
msgid "Use `unchecked_*` only after shape, non-emptiness, and singularity preconditions have already been enforced."
msgstr "只有在已经保证形状、非空和非奇异等前置条件时，才使用 `unchecked_*`。"

#: manual/tutorial/mutable/matrix.md:46
msgid "Reach for row/column views when one region of the matrix will be updated or inspected repeatedly."
msgstr "如果某一行或某一列会被重复读取或更新，优先使用行/列视图而不是反复手写索引。"

#: manual/tutorial/mutable/vector.md:1
msgid "mutable/vector tutorial"
msgstr "mutable/vector 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/mutable/vector.md:3
msgid "Small case: score a candidate with a working copy"
msgstr "小案例：用工作副本给候选项打分"

#: manual/tutorial/mutable/vector.md:28
msgid "This is a solid mutation-oriented pattern:"
msgstr "这是一个很典型的可变向量工作流："

#: manual/tutorial/mutable/vector.md:30
msgid "Keep the caller-facing vector unchanged."
msgstr "先保留调用方传进来的原始向量。"

#: manual/tutorial/mutable/vector.md:31
msgid "Take a `copy()` as a working buffer."
msgstr "用 `copy()` 拿一个工作副本。"

#: manual/tutorial/mutable/vector.md:32
msgid "Perform normalization and scaling with `map_inplace` and `left_scale_inplace`."
msgstr "在副本上用 `map_inplace` 和 `left_scale_inplace` 做归一化与放大。"

#: manual/tutorial/mutable/vector.md:34
msgid "Finish with `dot` once the vector is ready for scoring."
msgstr "最后再用 `dot` 算出分数。"

#: manual/tutorial/mutable/vector.md:39
msgid "Use `v[i]` and `v[i] = x` for direct element access."
msgstr "使用 `v[i]` 和 `v[i] = x` 直接访问或更新元素。"

#: manual/tutorial/mutable/vector.md:40
msgid "Use `map_inplace`, `left_scale_inplace`, and `right_scale_inplace` when mutation is intended."
msgstr "确实需要修改原值时，使用 `map_inplace`、`left_scale_inplace` 和 `right_scale_inplace`。"

#: manual/tutorial/mutable/vector.md:41
msgid "Use `dot`, `lin_comb`, `tensor_product`, `to_row_matrix`, and `to_col_matrix` when the vector participates in larger algebraic or matrix-building work."
msgstr "需要做归约、线性组合或矩阵转换时，使用 `dot`、`lin_comb`、`tensor_product`、`to_row_matrix` 和 `to_col_matrix`。"

#: manual/tutorial/mutable/vector.md:45
msgid "Use non-`inplace` helpers when you need a fresh vector instead of modifying the original."
msgstr "需要保留原向量时，使用那些不带 `inplace` 后缀的辅助函数。"

#: manual/tutorial/mutable/vector.md:46
msgid "Call `copy()` before mutating when a caller still needs the previous value."
msgstr "如果后续还要继续修改同一个值，先调用 `copy()` 再进行原地操作。"

#: manual/tutorial/mutable/vector.md:47
msgid "Reach for `dot`, `lin_comb`, and matrix-conversion helpers once the vector is participating in a larger numerical workflow."
